<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Benamanga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Njowo nofu ngita isimbilwe na Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Njowo nofu ngita isimbilwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matayo</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Njowo Nofu ngita isimbilwe na Matayo ndi kiganulo kimwi mugati lya figanulo fitai mu Liagano miya fyefihumulila uwu va Yesu Kilisito. Kila kiganulo kimwi kikemelwa Injili Mana lyake Njowo Nofu. Gyegisimbilwe Yesu peafuwe suwe. Fikasimbilwe na Matayo na Luka na Maliko na Yohani, vakwimba sevichela chipindi chisimbile hilo ndi paliki Matayo akasimbile kiganulo kyake kya Njowo nofu. Ila ilongeka kuva ikasimbilwe pa myaka ga sitini peababilwe Kilisito. Kangi pono pepisimbilwe sepichelwa, ila vangi vihocha kuva kikasimbiliwe ku Palesitina awu yevecha kuva mumwani va Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musimba va kiganulo iki nde Matayo, yeakali mdumula usulu peave Yesu seamkemeliye aveche muchulila vake. Kangi akachelilwe kwa litawa lya Lawi. Matayo akali nde yumwi mugati lya vanjagila kyumi na vavili na akavasimbiye njowo ichi va Vayawudi. Iyi iwoneka wachi ngita peawuyile makani kuchumba sitini kuhuma Liagano lya pamwandi. Akasakile kuwonesa kuva Yesu nde Masiha ambaye nde Kilisito mlowola yeahaguliwe na Nguluvi, yealaguliwe na Vavichi. Kangi Matayo akasimbile ga Ukomi va Nguluvi. Vayawudi vakahochile kuva Masiha nde avechile ng'achale va vang'achale va kisiasa. Matayo agehe unofu kwakupinja makani ago kwa kuhumulila unofu njowo cha ung'achale va kimuhe va Nguluvi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Njowo nofu yeasimbile Matayo nde kiganulo kinofu kuvangicha mu Liagano miya kwakuva lya kutumila wifungu kuhuma liagano lya pamwandi. Kiganulo iki kiwunganisa maagano gavili. Vakwimba vonga kuva iwesekana Matayo agechile kufwatila kusimba ngita peasimbile Musa, muganulo fihanu fya kwanja muliagano lya pamwandi. Madaliko gya Yesu pakidunda Matayo 5-7 giveswa kuwaniswa na pala Nguluvi peakali akumgavila Musa malagilicho kuwiwuka malagilicho.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gyegagehe</para>
  <para style="io">Matayo ivanga Njowo Nofu kwa kuhumulila, peababilwe Yesu Kilisito na Yesu peavangile kasi lyake musula lya 1-4</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi Matayo ihumulila kasi lya Yesu na mawulanichi gyake gyolofu musula lya 5-25.</para>
  <para style="io">Matayo imalila kwa kuhumulila pono ngomi hilo lya kasi lya Yesu mukufuwa na kuchulubuka kwa mwene musula lya 26-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Lukolo va Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka 3.23-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Aga nde matava gya lukolo va Yesu Kilisito yeababilwe mulukolo va Dawudi na dawudi akababilwe mulukolo va Ibulahimu.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Ibulahimu akambabile Isaka na Isaka akambabile Yakobo na Yakobo akambabile Yuda na vakolo vake, <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda akambabile Palesi na Zela maye vao akali Tamali. Palesi akambabile Esilomu na Esilomu akambabile Alamu, <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Alamu akambabile Aminadabu na Aminadabu akambabile Nashoni na Nashoni akambabile Salimoni, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salimoni akambabile Boazi, maye vake Boazi akali Lahabu na Boasi akambabile Obedi, maye vake Obedi akali Luti na Obedi akambabile Yese.<verse eid="MAT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Yese akambabile Dawudi yeakali ng'achale na Dawudi akambabile Selemani maye vake Selemani akali mdala va Uliya. <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Selemani akambabile Lehoboamu na Lehoboamu akambabile Abiya na Abiya akambabile Asa,<verse eid="MAT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa akambabile Yehoshafati na Yehoshafati akambabile Yolamu na Yolamu akambabile Uzia.<verse eid="MAT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uzia akambabile Yosamu na Yosamu akambabile Ahazi na Ahasi akambabile Hesekia.<verse eid="MAT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hesekia akambabile Manase na Manase akambabile Amoni na Amoni akambabile Yosia.<verse eid="MAT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosia akambabile Yekonia na vakolo vake. Chipindi Vayawudi pevahamichwe ku Babeli.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Vaisilaeli pevahamichwe ku Babeli, Yekonia akambabile Shealitieli na Shealitieli akambabile Zelubabeli. <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zelubabeli akambabile Abiudi, Abiudi akambabile Eliakimu na Eliakimu akambabile Azoli, <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azoli akambabile Sadoki, Sadoki akambabile Akimu na Akimu akambabile Eliudi, <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliudi akambabile Eleazali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:15">Eliazali akambabile Matani na Matani akambabile Yakobo.<verse eid="MAT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakobo akambabile Yusufu mgosi va Maliya, Maliya yeambabile Yesu yeikemelwa Kilisito yeahaguliwe na Nguluvi.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Suwe, kuhuma Ibulahimu mbaka kwa ng'achale Dawudi kukali na filelo kyumi na chitai. Kangi, kuhuma kwa ng'achale Dawudi mbaka Vaisilaeli pevahamiswe kusindikwa ku Babeli kukali na filelo fingi kyumi na chitai. Kangi kuhuma chipindi pevahamisilwe kufikila kubabwa kwa Kilisito yeahuguliwe na Nguluvi, kukali na filelo kyumi na fitai.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubabwa kwa Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luka 2.1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Suwe, kubabwa kwa Yesu Kilisito kukali ndena, Maliya maye vake Yesu, akali ahetilwe na Yusufu. Ila peave kumtola awonike kuva amilile miti lyeapatile kwa umwimike va Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Yusufu mgosi va Maliya, akali munu yeidikilwa pautalo lya Nguluvi, seakele kumgavila nyoni mdala vake pawelu, akasakile kumleka kwa lupwepo. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Peave iwocha lukani lula, ndumindumi va Mtwa akamuhumiye munjosi na kumlongela, “Yusufu mwana va Dawudi, bihile kuwogofya kumtola Maliya, kwakuva apatile lusololo kwa umwimike va Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Ibaba mwana mkigosi, dakumkemela litawa Yesu kwakuva akuvakombola vanu vake kuhuma musambi chawo.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Ago gyonda gahumile neke gatimile lichwi lya Mtwa lyalongile kuchumbila mvichi va Nguluvi kuva, <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Muhinja daimila miti. Ekumbaba mwana mgosi, mwene daikemelwa litawa Emanueli Mana lyake Nguluvi agehe pamwinga na nefwe.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Mwene Yusufu pealamwike, akamtola Maliya ngita ndumindumi va Mtwa peamlongile. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Ila seakagonile nave mbaka Maliya peababile mlongola mgosi. Suwe, Yusufu akamtambucha litawa Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Vagenji kuhuma pelihumila lichuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Yesu akababilwe kumwani va Betelehemu muinyi lya Yudeya, chipindi Helode peakali Ng'achale. Bahobaho, vanu veviimbile nondwa vafikile ku Yelusalemu kuhuma lubali pelihumila lichuwa, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />vakahuchile, “Agehe kwiya mwana yeababilwe daivecha Ng'achale va Vayahudi? Twiwene nondwa lyake lubali lwa kuhumila lichuwa, twachile kumgundamila.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Ng'achale Helode peapulike ago, akalandamwike kwa wogofi, mwene pamwi na vanu vonda va mwani va Yelusalemu. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Helode akavakemela vatekechi vakomi vonda pamwi na vawulanichi va Malagilicho gya Musa gyeagavilwe na Nguluvi, akavahuchile, “Kilisito daibabwa kwiya?”<verse eid="MAT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Navo vakamuhigile, “Daibabwa kumwani Betelehemu muinyi lya Yudea. Ngita peasimbile mvichi va Nguluvi mumasimbo.”<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />“Veve Betelehemu muinyi lya Yudea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">veve se mdodo mugati lya mwani cha Yudeya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">kwakuva kwa veve daihumila kilongochi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">daakuvalongocha vanu vangu va Isilaeli.”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Baho Helode akavakemelie avo vevikwimbile nondwa pono kwihela vanu, neke vamlongie undakyene chipindi liki hilo pemuiwene nondwa ila. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Baho akavalagiche ku Betelehemu akilonga, “Muhelele mkasake kwa unofu makani gya mwana uyo. Dapemumuwene muwuyise mahigo neke na nene ndihelele kumgundamila.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Pevampulikile ng'achale, vevimbile nondwa vakaiwene ila nondwa vakakeduka hilo, vakahele nalyo ila nondwa yevaiwene palubali kuhumila lichuwa ikavalongue, navo vakaifuatile mbaka peimile pono pala peagehe mwana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Pevaiwene yila nondwa imile vakakeduke hilo. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Pevaingie mukaye vakamwene yula mwana pamwi na maye vake, navo vakamfugamile. Baho vakavopuwe lusanja chawo na vakamgavila fupo, sahabu na manung'ililo na mgoda va vana.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Nguluvi akavakanile munjosi vala vevimbile nondwa vabihile kuwuya kwa Helode, suwe vakawuyile kukaye lyao kwa kuchumbila ng'asi yingi.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunyilila ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Pevahegile vala vevaimbile nondwa, ndumindumi va Mtwa akamuhumie Yusufu munjosi akamlongiye, “Lamuke, munyamule mwana na maye vake mnyilile ku Misili. Mwikale ukoya mbaka pendikuvalongela, kwakuva Helode ing'ang'a kumdocha uyo mwana.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Suwe, Yusufu akalamke, akamnyamula mwana na maye vake pamiye wuwula vakahegile kuhelela ku Misili, <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />vakalile ukoya mbaka peafue Helode. Lukani ulo ligitilwe neke litimile luchowo lyealongile Mtwa kuchumbila vavichi vake kuva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:15">“Ndimkemeliye mwana vangu kuhuma ku Misili.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vana vakigosi vidochwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Helode peachele kuva vala veviimbile nondwa sevawuyile kumlongela gevagavene, akavipile hilo. Akaswitiliche vana vakigosi vonda mumwani lwa Betelehemu na vala vevali pono lya pepi vevali na miyaka givili na vevakali panyi lya miyaka givili vadochwe. Akagitile ndena kuhumana na kila kyealongilwe na vala veviimbile nondwa.<verse eid="MAT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Nde peitimile luchowo lyealongile mvichi Yelemia kuva,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Lichwi likapulikike ukoya ku Lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">kivembo na makivilicho gyolofu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Laheli akuvavembela vana vake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Akakanile kuchikichwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">kwakuva vonda vafue.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya kuhuma ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Peafue Helode, ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi akamuhumiye Yusufu munjosi ukoya ku Misili, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />akamlongile, “Lamke! Mnyamule mwana na maye vake, muwuye kangi muinyi lya Isilaeli, kwakuva vala vevakang'ang'ile kumdocha mwana vafue.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Baho Yusufu akalamwike, akamnyamule mwana pamwi na maye vake vakawuye muinyi lya Isilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Ila Yusufu peapulike kuva Alikelao mwana va Helode avechile ng'achale va Yudea, muhala va ung'achale va daada vake, akaogwipe kuhelela ukoya. Namwene peakanilwe munjosi, akahele muinyi lya Galilaya, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />akahelela kwikala mumwani weukemelwa Nasaleti. Ndeni peivechile njowo chechilongilwe kuchumbila vavichi va Nguluvi kuva, “Daikemelwa munu va Nasaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohani mbatisa akuvadalikila vanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliko 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohani 1.19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Mufigono ifyo, Yohani Mbatisa akahachile kuno idalika mudasi lya Yudea. <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />Akavalongiye “Muleke sambi chenu mumuwuyile Nguluvi, kwakuva ung'achale va kuluhano ugehe pepi.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Yohani uyu ndi yula yealongiwe makani gyake na mvichi Isaya kuva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">“Munu yumwi ikemela kukwelu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">Mumgelanichile Mtwa ng'asi lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">muigolole ng'asi lyake.”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Yohani akafalile mwenda veuhonilwe kwa magala gya mng'oko ikemelwa ngamia, na lifunga lwa ngwembe mukigudi. Kyakulia kyake kikali midedema na luki. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Vanu kuhuma ku Yelusalemu na Uyawudi yonda, na inyi chonda che chigehe mung'umbung'umbu lya mgoka va Yolidani vakamuhelelie Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Navo vakahongecha sambi chawo na akavabatisa mumgoka va Yolidani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Ila peavawene Mafalisayo volofu na Vasadukayo vakumuheleliya neke avabatise, akavalongie, “Nyenye kilelo kya liyoka! Ndi ani avalongiye munyile luhigo lwelukwacha? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Suwe, muwonese kwa magito kuva muhongiche, <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />vala mubihile kuhocha na kwilongela munumbula chenu, Daada vetu ndi Ibulahimu ndakyene ndikuvalongela, Nguluvi ivesa kugagita maganga aga gaveche vana va Ibulahimu! <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Livago livikilwe suwe mumidadikwa gya mibiki, kila libiki lyeselibaba manunu manono lidumulwa na kutagwa mulyoto. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Nene ndikuvabatisa kwa malenga kuwonesa kuva muhongiche sambi chenu. Ila yeikwacha kumbele lyangu agehe na umwimike kuchumba nene, nene sendidikilwa ata kunyamula makobasi gyake. Mwene akuvabatisa kwa Muhe va Nguluvi na kwa lyoto. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Mwene agehe na luhelo mumawoko gyake daifyagila pono pakupetela, neke apetele mabenelo gyake na kugavika mulusanja lwake na dainyanya miyeyela mulyoto weseuchima.” <figure style="fig" file="06 Threshing.jpg" size="col" ref="3.12">Munu ipeta </figure><verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ibatiswa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maliko 1.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3.21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Chipindi icho Yesu akahegile mumwani va Galilaya mbaka mgoka Yolidani neke abatiswe na Yohani Mbatisa. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Ila Yohani akagechile kumkanila akilonga, “Nene nding'ang'a kubatiswa na veve, kangi na veve wachile kubatiswa na nene!”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Yesu akamhigile, “Veve dikile hela kwakuva tung'angw'a kugagita gala gyonda gyeikela Nguluvi.” Baho Yohani akaidikila akambatise.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Baho Yesu peabatiswe, akahuma mumalenga. Baho baho luwano chikadindwike, akawene Muhe va Nguluvi ikwika ngita ng'unda na kutula pakyanya lyake. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Lichwi kuhuma kuluhano ikalongile, “Uyu nde mwana vangu yendimkeliye yeakunikedusa hilo.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu igechwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:12">Maliko 1.12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4.1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Baho Muhe va Nguluvi akamlongocha Yesu mbaka kukwelu neke agechwe na Setani. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Akadindile kuliya figono alobaini pamunyi na pamiye, pambele njala ikamvavile. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Setani akamhelelie Yesu akamlongie, “Ngita veve nde mwana va Nguluvi, galongele maganga aga gaveche mibumunda.” <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Isimbilwe mumasimbo ga Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:4">Munu seakwikala kwa kuliya libumunda hela, ila kwa kila luchowo lyeilonga Nguluvi.”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Baho, Setani akamlongocha Yesu mbaka ku Yelusalemu, mwani va Nguluvi, akamvikile pakineng'eneng'e lya kaye lya Nguluvi, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />akamlongie, “Ngita, veve ndi mwana va Nguluvi, witage panyi, kwakuva isimbilwe mumasimbo gya Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">Nguluvi akuvalagilicha ndumindumi vake kwajili lya veve,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">navo vakukunyamula mumawoko gyao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">ubihile kwikwambadula paliganga.”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu akamlongiye, “Isimbilwe mumasimbo gya Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:7">Ubihile kumgecha Mtwa, Nguluvi vako.”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Baho, Setani akamlongocha pakidunda kitali, akamuonesile ung'achale weugehe kuinyi yonda na unofu vake, <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />akamlongie, “Fyonda ifi dandikugavila ngita dakunifugamila na kunifunyila.” <verse eid="MAT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Baho, Yesu akamlongie, “Hege baha Setani! Isimbilwe mumasimbo ga Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:10">Umfunye Mtwa Nguluvi vako na kumfunya Nguluvi weka hela.”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Suwe, Setani akamleka na ndumindumi va Nguluvi vakahachile kumtanga.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ivanga kasi ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maliko 1.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4.14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Suwe, Yesu peapulike kuva Yohani vamvikile mukiwopo akahelelie ku Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Akahegile Nazaleti, akahelela kwikala mumwani lya Kapelinaum veugehe pawipi na inyanza lya Galilaya, mumbaka va inyi lya Zabuloni na Nafutali, akalile ukoya. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Neke litimiye lila luchowo lyelilongilwe na Isaya mvichi va Nguluvi kuva,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Inyi lya Zabuloni na Inyi lya Nafutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">chigehe mung'asi lya kuhelela ku lihiva kumwambo lya mgoka Yolidani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilaya inyi lya vanu se Vayahudi!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Vanu vevikalile mukisi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">vauwene welu mkomi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Navo vala vevikalie muinyi lya kisi na vene wogofi va kufuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">welu uvang'alichile!”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Kuhuma baho Yesu akavangile kudalika kuno akilonga, “Muhongeche sambi chenu, kwakuva ung'achale va kuluhano ugehe pepi!”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvakemela valowa somba vatai</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maliko 1.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka 5.1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yesu peakali igenda mung'umbung'umbu lya lihiva Galilaya, akavawene vakolo vavili valowa somba, Simoni yeikemelwa Peteli na Andelea yeakali lukolo vake, vakali vilowa somba kwa nyafu mulihiva. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yesu akavalongie, “Mwache, nene ndikuvagita muniletele vanu ngita valowa somba pevileta somba pakaye.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Bahobaho vakachilekile nyafu chao na vakamfuatile Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Peahele pautalo padodo, akavawene vakolo vangi vavili, Yakobo na Yohani, vana va Sebadayo. Avo vakali mugati lya wato pamwi na daada vawo Sebedayo. Vakali visambula nyafu chawo. Na Yesu akavakemela, <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />bahobaho vakamleka daada vawo mu wato, vakahele kwa Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvawulanicha vanu na kuvananicha vatamwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka 6.17-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yesu akali ihelela kila pono lya mwani va Galilaya, akiwulanicha mukaye lya kutang'anila Vayahudi, kuno idalika Njowo Nofu cha ung'achale va Nguluvi, akavananicha vatamwa na kila ayina lya matamwa gyegakali kwa vanu. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Njowo chake chikalutala pono ponda ku inyi lya Silia. Vatamwa vonda vene matamwa gya kila iyina na vala vevagudile. Vevitamika mihoka na vene kilibisi na vanu vevali vatenda vakasindikwe kwa Yesu na akavananiche vonda. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Mapinga golofu gya vanu kuhuma ku Galilaya na Dekapoli na Yelusalemu na Yudea na kumwambo lya mgoka Yolidani, gakamufatile.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvawulanicha vanu pakidunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Yesu peagawene mapinga gya vanu, akakang'ie pakidunda, peakalile panyi. Vachulila vake vakamuheleliye, <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />mwene akavangile kuvawulanicha.<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukeduko lwa undakyene</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka 6.20-23</ref></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Vafunyilwe vala vevikwichela kuva seviwesa kwikala ngajila Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:3">kwakuva Ung'achale va Kuluhano ndi vawo.”<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />“Vafunyilwe vevagehe na luswigimo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:4">kwakuva Nguluvi davanamachwa.”<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />“Vafunyilwe vala vafokomasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:5">kwakuva davihala inyi.”<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />“Vafunyilwe vala vevali na njala na ng'elu lya kugita gyeikela Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:6">kwakuva Nguluvi dakuvagwitisa.”<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />“Vafunyilwe vala vevakuvawonela vangi lusungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:7">na Nguluvi davawonelwa lusungu.”<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />“Vafunyilwe vala vevakumjuma Nguluvi kwa numbula chawo chonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:8">kwakuva davamwene Nguluvi.”<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />“Vafunyilwe vala vevivika lutengamaso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:9">kwakuva davakemelwa vana va Nguluvi.”<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />“Vafunyilwe vala vevigudwa kwa kugita gala gye ing'ang'a Nguluvi,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:10">kwakuva Ung'achale va Kuluhano nde vawo.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />“Mfunyilwe nyenye, vanu pedavakuvaliga na kuvagudisa na kuvalongelela njowo cha udesi kwajili ya nene.” <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Muheke na kunemelela kwakuva fupo lyenu ngomi ivikilwe kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. Kwakuva ndeni peikali kwa vanu vevakali vakuvaguda vavichi va Nguluvi vevakali valonguwe pautalo lyenu.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyenye ndi ngita munyo na welu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maliko 9.50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luka 14.34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />Yesu akalongile, “Nyenye ndi munyo lya inyi. Ila munyo ikiyaga unofu vake wigita wuli neke ikole kangi? Se ivecha nofu kangi, ila itagwa kwivala na kukinywa na vanu.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />“Nyenye ndi welu va inyi. Mwani weuchengilwe pakidunda se uvecha kwifiya. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Kwihela munu yeikwasa taa na kugubika kwa kiviya, ila ivika pakyanya pakinu neke kivang'aliche vonda vevagehe mukaye. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Ndeni ndeni, welu venu uvalangachile vanu, neke vagawene magito gyenu manofu, vamunjume Daada venu yeagehe kuluhano.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawulanicho gya Yesu kutigila malagilicho gya Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Mubihile kuhocha kuva ndachile kutiligicha malagilicho gya Nguluvi gyeamgavile Musa na mawulanicho gya vavichi va Nguluvi, ila ndachile kulonga undakyene va njowo icho. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Ila ndakyene ndikuvalongela, mbaka luhano na inyi dafichumba, ila kwihela ata pono ndodo lya lulagilicho lya Musa, daihechwa, mbaka fyonda fyefisimbilwe fihumile. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Ndeni, munu yeyonda daseidikila ata lulagilicho limwi ndodo kuchumba chonda na kuvawulanicha vangi vabihile kwidikila uyo daivecha mdodo hilo muung'achale va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. Ila yula daikuchidikila na kuvawulanicha vangi, uyo daivecha mkomi muung'achale va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Ndikuvalongela, mwing'ang'wa muidikile malagilicho ga Nguluvi geamgavile Musa kwa unofu kuchumba vala Vawulanichi va malagilicho na Vafalisayo. Ngita dasemgita ndeni, dasemwingila ng'odo muung'achale va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawulanichi ga kuvakanila vanu vabihile kuvipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Mukapulike vanu vadaha pevalongilwe kuva, Ubihile kudocha munu! Na munu yeyonda daidocha munu, daihigwa.” <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Ila nene ndikuvalongela, yeyonda yeakumvipila lukolo vake, ing'ang'wa kuhigwa. Yeakumbeda lukolo vake daisindikwa mulidamwa kuhigwa. Na yeyonda daikumliga lukolo vake kuva, mpufi ing'ang'wa kwingila mulyoto seuchima mbepali. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Suwe, peuhecha usembe vako pakitangavala kya maganga na peuwiwuka kuva mkolo vako agehe na ndewo na veve, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />uleke usembe vako pautalo lya kitangavala kya maganga, uhelele tandi kunjengakaya na lukolo vako, pambele uwuye ukaheche usembe vako.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“Mnjengekaye kisatu na mlata vako pemgehe mung'asi kuhelela kuludamwa. Neke mlata vako abihile kukusindika kwa mhiga nongwa na mhiga nongwa akusindika kwa mpuga na dauvikwa mukiwopo. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Ndakyene ndikulongela, daseuhuma mula mbaka uhombe sendi lya mwiso.”<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawulanicho ga kukanila ugoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Mukapulike kuva vanu vakalongilwe, mubihile kugita ugoni!” <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Ila nene ndikuvalongela, daikumlola mdala kwa kumdobokela, agonile nave suwe munumbula lyake. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Suwe, liho lyako lya liwoko lya ndewo likugitile ugite sambi, likule ulitage kutali. Ngiba veve uyagiche kinu kimwi mumvili vako kuliko muvili vako vonda kutagwa mulyoto seuchima mbepali. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Ngita liwoko lyako lya ndewo likugitile ugite sambi, udumule ukatage kutali. Ngiba uyagiche kinu kimwi mumvili vako, kuliko mvili vako vonda utagwe mulyoto seuchimika mbepali.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawulanichi gya kukana kwileka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matayo 19.9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maliko 10.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16.18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Ikalongilwe kuva, munu yeyonda yeakumleka mdala vake, ing'ang'wa amugavile baluwa lya kwileka.” <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Ila nene ndikuvalongela, munu yeyonda seing'ang'wa kumleka mdala vake kwa nongwa lyolyonda lila, ila kwa nongwa lya ugoni hela. Na munu dakumleka mdala vake kwa nongwa lyolyonda lila akumgita mdala aveche mgoni. Na munu yeyonda daimtola mdala uyo namwene igita ugoni.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawulanichi gya kulapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Kangi mupulike kuva vanu vadaha vakalongilwe, ngita uvikile ujangile kwa Nguluvi, wing'ang'wa kugita gala gyeujangile.” <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Ila nene ndikuvalongela, mubihile kwilapa, iveche kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, kwakuva ndikigoda kya ung'chale va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />vala mubihile kwiyilapila inyi, kwakuva ndi pono pakuvikila magulu ga Nguluvi na mubihile kwilapa kwa Yelusalemu, kwakuva ndi mwani va Mng'achale mkomi. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Kangi ubihile kwilapa kwa kituwe kyako, kwakuva seuvesa kuugita ufwili vako uveche uvalafu awu utitu. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Ukilonga, ena iveche ena ukilonga, hamu Iveche hamu. Kyokyonda dakigina kihuma kwa yula muwofu.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawulanichi ga kukanila kuwisa kisasi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luka 6.29-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Mupulike kuva ilongilwe, munu akikulemecha liho na veve mlemache liho lyake na munu akikulemacha lino lyako na veve mlemache lino lyake.” <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Ila nene ndikuvalongela, ubihile kuwisa kisasi kwa munu yeakugitile nongwa. Munu peakutova licheche lya liwoko lya ndewo, msedukile na lya upili. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Munu yeakusindika kuludamo kusaka kukunyamulila ligwanda lyako, mleke anyamule na koti lyako. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Munu peakuswitilicha kunyamula mchigo vake kilomita imwi veve nyamule kilomita chivili. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Yeakusuka mgavile, ubihile kumkacha munu yeikwacha kukuachima kinu.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvakela vachundamwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luka 6.27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Mupulike kuva ikalongilwe, mkele mganja vako na kumvipila mchundamwa vako.” <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Ila nene ndikuvalongela, muvakele vachundamwa venu na kuvasukila kwa Nguluvi vala vevakuvagudisa nyenye, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />neke muveche vana va Daada venu yeagehe kuluhano. Kwakuva mwene akuvang'alichila lichua lyake vanu vawofu na vanofu na kuvatonyela ndonya vanu vevigita makani gegikumkelesa na vala sevigita makani segikumkelesa. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Damwipata fupo liki kwa kuvakela vala vevakuvakela nyenye hela? Kwihela! Kwakuva ata vadumula usulu vigita ndeni! <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Ngita mukuvagitila manofu vemukuvachela hela, wuli, damukuvagina liki? Ata vanu sevakumchela Nguluvi vigita ndeni. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Suwe, mubihile kupwemukilwa na kyokyonda ngita Daada venu va kuluhano seapwemukilwe na kyokyonda.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Kuvatanga vahangala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />“Mwilolele mubihile kugita finu fyenu finofu pautalo lya vanu neke avanjume. Kwakuva pemugita ago, Daada venu yeagehe kuluhano seakuvagavila fupo.”<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />“Suwe peukumtanga muhangala, ubihile kwilandula kwa vanu. Mubihile kugita ngita vafyangu pevigita mukaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi na mung'asi neke vanu vavanjume. Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, avo vapatile suwe fupo lyao. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Ila veve peukumtanga muhangala, gite ndeni ata munu vako va pepi abihile kuchela. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Heche utangilo vako kwa lupwepo na Daada vako va kuluhano yeilola gyegifyamile, daakugavila fupo.”<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawulanichi gya kumsuka Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka 11.2-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Pemwisuka, mubihile kugita ngita vafyangu. Vene vikela kufunya kuno vimile mukaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi na palubali lya ng'asi neke vanu vavawene. Ndakyene, ndikuvalongela, avo vawanuke suwe fupo lyao. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Ila veve peukumsuka Nguluvi, wingile mukyumba kyako, dinde mlyangilo, baho umsuke Daada vako seiwoneka. Na Daada vako yeilola gyegafyamile, daakugavila fupo lyako.”<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />“Pemwisuka kwa Nguluvi, mubihile kubwatuka bwatuka ngita vanu sevakumchela Nguluvi. Kwakuva vene viwocha kuva Nguluvi daavapulikicha kwa njowo chawo chongofu. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Mubihile kuvecha ngita vene. Kwakuva Daada venu agachele gyemwisuka ata ngita mwave kumsuka. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Suwe, ndeni nde mwing'ang'wa kumsuka Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">Daada vetu yeugehe kuluhano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">litawa lyako linjumwe.<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Ung'achale vake wache.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">Lyeung'ang'a kugita ukoya kuluhano gagitwe na baha muinyi.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Utugavile neng'uli kyakula kyetu kya kila kigono.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Utuhechele nongwa chetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">ngita nefwe petukuvahechela vevatugitiye nongwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Ubihile kutugavila magecho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">ila utulowole na yula muwofu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">Kwakuva Ung'achale nde vako na ludali na ukomi mbaka mbepali. Ndakyene.”<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />“Kwakuva pemkuvahechela vanu nogwa chawo, Daada venu va kuluhano daakuvahechela na nyenye kangi. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Ila ngita semukuvahechela vayenu nongwa chawo, Daada venu sevakuvahechela nyenye lusungu.”<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagilicho mukudinda kulya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Pemwikwikanila kuliya kyakula mubihile kuvecha ngita vafyangu vevikwigita kuva vagehe na lusugwimo na kukikinyala wuso vagita ndena, neke vawoneke pavanu kuva vayikanile kulya. Ndikuvalongela ndakyene, avo vapatile suwe fupo lyao. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Ila veve peukwikanila kuliya, bake kituwe kyako mafuta, kalave wuso vako, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />neke munu yeyonda abihile kuchela kuva uyikanile kuliya, ila uchelwe hela na Daada vako yeseiwoneka. Na Daada vako yeilola gyegyafyamile, daakuvika unofu.”<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lusanja lwa kuluhano kwa Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luka 12.33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Mbihile kwivikila lusanja baha pa inyi kwakuva pungulusi na kutu vihanaga na vahichi vikwingila na kuhicha. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Mwivikile lusanja chenu kuluhano kwa Nguluvi kwihela pungulusi na kutu vakuhananga, vala vahichi sevikwingila kuhicha. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Kwakuva kula peugehe lusanja lwako nde peugehe numbula lyako.”<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liho nde welu va mvili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka 11.34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Liho nde taa lya muvili. Ngita liho lyako lilola unofu na muvili vako vonda dawuvecha muwelu. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Ila ngita liho lyako nde liwofu na muvili vako vonda uvecha mukisi. Suwe, ngita welu wugehe mugati lyako nde kisi, suwe, ilyo nde kisi totolo!”<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumkela Nguluvi awu kukela finu fyolofu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka 16.13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12.22-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />Kwihela munu yeivesa kuvagumbanikila vatwa vavili. Kwakuva ukumvipila yumwi na kumkela yungi awu uvecha pamwi na yumwi na kumbeda yula yungi. Se muvesa kumgumbanikila Nguluvi na finu fyolofu pamwi.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />“Nde kwakuva ndikuvalongela, mbihile kuvecha na wogofi pakyanya lya kyakulia awu kyakunyuwa fyemung'ang'a neke mwikale. Wuli, kwakulya nde ngiba hilo kuchumba uwumi na myenda nde ngiba hilo kuchumba muvili? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Mulole fidege va kukyanya, sevivyala vala sevibena vala vihela lusanja lyolyonda. Ila Daada venu va kuluhano uvagavila kyakulya. Wuli, fidege nde ngiba hilo kuchumba nyenye? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Wuli, nde ani pagati lyenu kwakuva lya wogofi mkomi, iwesa kwihongelecha kukala hilo?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Wuli, wigudika kwakuva lya myenda? Mulole uluva va kudasi pegyikula unofu. Segigita kasi vala segihonela myenda gyao. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Ila ndikuvalongela, ata ng'achle Sulemani mwene na finu fyake fyolofu seakafwalile unofu ngita limwi lya uluva ulo. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Suwe, ngita Nguluvi akulivika makwati kya mgunda, gegagehe neng'uli na kilawu gitagwa paliyoto. Nyenye vanu yemugehe na ludikilo ludodo, wuli, Nguluvi seiwesa kuvagitila ndeni?”<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />“Suwe, mbihile kuvecha na wogofi, twiliya liki? Twinyuwa liki? Twifala liki?” <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Vanu sevakumchela Nguluvi nde vigudikila ago. Daada venu va kuluhano ichela kuva mwing'ang'a finu ifyo fyonda. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Ila, musake tandi ung'achale va Nguluvi na kwikala ngita ikela na ago gyonda damlutichilwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Suwe, mubihile kuvecha na wogofi kutigila kilawo, kwakuva kilawo ikuyigumbanikila yiyene. Kila kigono kigehe na utatala vake.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Mawulanicho ga kukanila kuvahiga vangi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luka 6.37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:38">38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41">41</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:42">42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />Baho, Yesu akalongela, “Mubihile kumlongela munu yeyonda, veve munu muwofu. Ngita peugita ndeni, Nguluvi daakulongela, veve ndi munu muwofu,” <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />kwakuva pekumlongela munu yungi kuva muwofu nde ndeni ndeni daulongelwa kuva veve ndi muwofu, kwa lulagilicho lulula lyemutumila kwa vangi nde lulula dalutumila kwa nyenye ndeni. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Wuli, ukilola kiyeyela kyekigehe muliho lya mweyago, ila se wilola liyeyela lyeligehe muliho lyako? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Uwesa wuli kumlongela lukolo vako, “Lukolo chinde ndikuheche kiyeyele muliho lyako. Chipindi veve ugehe na liyeyele muliho lyako? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Veve nde mfyangu! Heche tandi kiyeyele kyekigehe mulio lyako, baho daulola unofu na kuhecha liyeyele lye ligehe muliho lya lukolo vako.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Mubihile kuvagavila mibuwa finu fyefivikilwe kwakuva lya Nguluvi vabihile kuseduka na kuvaluma na kuvalemacha nyenye, vala mubihile kuvagavila vangubi finu fyenu finofu vabihile kuchivatila.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musuke na musake na mkong'ole mlyangilo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka 11.9-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Msuke kwa Nguluvi, nyenye damugavilwa, musake nyenye damwipata, mkong'ole mlyangilo na nyenye damwidinduliwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Kwakuva kila munu yeisuka igavilwa na yeisaka ipata na yeikong'ola mlyangilo idundiliwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Wuli, kugehe na yeyonda pagati lyenu mwana vake agite kumsuka libumunda, dakumgavila liganga? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Wuli, akimsuka somba dakumgavila liyoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Ndeni ata ngita nyenye ndi vawofu, mwichela kuvagavila vana venu finu finofu, ndakyene Daada venu va kuluhano igita hilo, dakuvagavila finu finofu vala vevakumsuka.<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />“Gyonda gyemwikela vanu vavagitile nyenye, muvagitile ndeni vavene. Kwakuva ago nde malagilicho ga Nguluvi geamgavile Musa na mawulanichi gya vavichi va Nguluvi.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'asi nyehe na ng'asi ngomi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka 13.24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Mwingile kuchumbila mlyangilo mdebe. Kwakuva ng'asi yeilongocha mukufuwa ndi ngomi na mlyangilo va kwingilila mumo nde mkomi, vevihelela ng'asi ilyo nde volofu. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Ila ng'asi yeilongocha muuwumi nde nyehe na mlyangilo va kwingilila ukoya nde nyehe na vanu vakefu davayiwona ng'asi yiyo.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libiki na manunu gyake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luka 6.43-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Muyiyepe na vavichi va udesi. Vene vikwacha kwa nyenye kuno viwonekana ngita kondolo kwa kwivala, ila kwa mugati ndi mikeve vang'ali. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Damukuvachela kwa manunu gyao ago nde magito gyao. Wuli, vanu viyawa misabibu palibiki ga mihomi awu nunu lya tini pamisamponda? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Suwe, libiki linofu ubaba manunu ganofu, ila libiki liwofu libaba manunu seganofu. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Libiki linofu selivecha kubaba manunu mawofu na libiki liwofu seliwesa kubaba manunu manofu. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Kila libiki se libaba manunu ganofu hudumulwa na kutagwa muliyoto. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Ndena, damukuvachela kwa magito gyao.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sendikuvachela nyenye</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luka 13.25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Se kila munu yeakunilongela, Mtwa, Mtwa, Daikwingila muung'achale va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, ila daingila ndi yula yeigita gyeikela Daada vangu yeagehe kuluhano. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Mukigono yila volofu davakunilongela, ‘Mtwa, Mtwa! Kwa litawa lyako tukalandule njowo chako na kwa litawa lyako tukahecha mahoka na kugita umanyitu wolofu.’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Baho, ndikuvalongela, ‘Ndakyene sendikuvachela nyenye, muhege baha, nyenye vagita mawofu.’<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vachengi kaya vavili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luka 6.47-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Suwe, kila munu yeakugapulika njowo changu na kugagita, iwana na munu munya luhala, yeachengile kaye lyake paliganga. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Ndonya ikatonya na migoka ikamemile na lukala lukomi lukapugile na kuitova kaye ilyo. Ila seikaguwe kwakuva ikachengwile paliganga.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />“Ila yeyonda yeipulika njowo changu, ila seakugagita, iwana na munu mpufi yeachengile kaye lyake pamuhanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Ndonya ikatonya, migoka ikamemile na lukala lukomi ukapugile na kutova kaya ilyo, nalyo ikaguwa buuu.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umwimike va Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Yesu peamalile kulonga njowo icho, lipinga lya vanu likadudwive na mawulanichi gyake. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Seakali ngita vawulanicha vawo va malagilicho, ila akawulaniche kwa umwimike.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akumnanicha munu yeagehe na lukalavilo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maliko 1.40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5.12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Yesu peikile pakidunda, mipinga gyolofu gya vanu gakamufatile. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Suwe, akachile munu yumwi mwene lukalavilo na akamufugamile na akalongile, “Mtwa, ngita ukela, vawesa kuning'alicha!” <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yesu akagonjolola liwoko, akambyalisa na kulonga, “Ndikela! Ung'alichwe.” Baho yula munu akananile lukalavilo vake. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Pambele, Yesu akamulongiye, “Ubihile kumlongela munu yeyonda, ila helele uyiwonese kwa mtekechi na kuhecha usembe ngita pealagiliche Musa, uveche uswida kuva unanile.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudikila kwa mkomi va vapuga va ku Loma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka 7.1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Yesu peakali ikwingila mwani va Kapelianaumu, mpuga yumwi akamuheleliye akamsukile, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />akalongile, “Mtwa, mnyegendwa vangu avasile kukaye, mtamwa va lugaso na ivawa hilo.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Ndikwacha kumnanicha.” <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Kilongochi va vapuga uyo akamulongiye, “Mtwa, nene sending'ang'wa veve kwingila mukaye lyangu. Ila longe luchowo hela na mnyegendwa vangu dainana. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Kwakuva ata nene ndi munu ndigehe panyi lya umwimike va vangi, ndinavyo vapuga vangi vevagehe panyi lya umwimike vangu. Ndikumlongela yumwi, ‘Helele na ihelela na yungi.’ ‘Wache!’ Na ikwacha na ndikimlongela mnyigendwa vangu, ‘Gite kinu iki’ mwene igita.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Yesu peapulike njowo icho, akadudwive, akavalongiye vanu vevakali vakumufuata, “Ndakyene, sendimwonile munu yeyonda mu Isilaeli yeagehe na ludikilo ngita iyi. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Suwe, ndikuvalongela kuva vanu volofu vikwacha kuhuma pelihumila lichuwa na pelidibala lichuwa, navo vakwikala pamwi na Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo muung'achale va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Ila Vaisilaeli volofu vevang'ang'ilwe kuvecha muung'achale avo davatagwa kwivala mukisi, ukoya davivemba na kusigina mino.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Kangi Yesu akamlongiye yula kilongochi va vapuga va Loma, “Helele kukaye na yiveche ngita peudikiye.” Mnyigendwa vake akananile baho baho.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvananicha vanu volofu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maliko 1.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4.38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Yesu peakafikile pakaye lya Peteli, akamuwena mganafu va Peteli avasile paulili na ivawa hilo. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Baho Yesu akambyalisa yula maye liwoko na akananile, akaimile na akavanga kuvatelekela.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Peyifikile palumiye, vakamsindikiye Yesu vanu volofu vevakali vitamika na lihoka, nave kwa kulonga luchowo hela, akavadagile mahoka. Akavananiche kangi vanu vonda vevali vatamwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Akagitile ndena neke gala gealongile mvichi Isaya gatimile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">“Yumwene anyamuwe uvawa vetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">akategule matamwa gyetu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Veving'ang'wa kuvecha vachulila va Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka 9.57-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Yesu pealiwene lipinga lya vanu limchungutile, akavalongile vachulila vake vahagame kumwambo lya lihiva. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Muwulanichi yumwi va lulagilicho akamweleliye, akamlongile, “Muwulanichi nene ndikwacha kokonda peuhelela.” <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesu akamhigile, “Vakeve vagehe na manga na fidege vana fyaso, ila Mwana va Munu ihela pono pakutulula.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Kangi munu yungi mugati lya vachulila vake akamlongile, “Mtwa, nileke tandi ndihelele ndikamsile daada vangu.” <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Ila Yesu akamhigile, “Wache! Uvaleke vanu vafuwe vavasile vafuwe vawo.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulongela lukala uleke kupuga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maliko 4.35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8.22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Baho, Yesu akakang'ie muwato na vachulila vake vakahelela pamwi na mwene. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Pevakali vihehelela, bahobaho likapugile lukala mulihiva na madaba gakavangile kudibacha wato. Ila Yesu akali mutulo. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Vachulila vake vakamuheleliye, vakamulamusa vakilonga, “Utulowole Mtwa twifuwa!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Yesu akavalongela, “Nyenye vanu vemubihila kudikila, wuli mwikogopa?” Suwe akaimile akaukabusa lukala na lihiva likali kwihela lukala kangi. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Vachulila vake vakadudwiva, vakalonga, “Uyu munu ani? Mbaka lukala na inyanza vikumpulikicha!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvananicha vanu vavili vene mahoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maliko 5.1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8.26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Yesu akafikile muinyi lya Vagadala, kumwambo lya lihiva, ukoya akatang'anile na vanu vavili vevakali na mahoka vevahumile kumgunda va Nguluvi. Vanu avo vakali vakuwahogofecha hilo vanu, kukali kwihela munu yeakagelile kuchumba ng'asi ilyo. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Navo vakavanga kubwata, “Wisaka liki kwa nefwe, veve mwana va Nguluvi? Wuli, wachile kutuguda chipindi chikali kwacha?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Pepi na pono baha pakali na vagubi volofu vakuliya. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Suwe, mahoka vakamusukile Yesu, “Ngita wikela kutuhecha, suwe, utulongele tukavaingile vangubi vala.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yesu akavalongile, “Muhelele” Bahobaho, vakavahega vanu avo vakavaingila vala vangubi. Lipinga lyonda lya vangubi likaikile paligema likomi, likadibala mulihiva, vangubi vonda vakafuwe mumalenga.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Ila vadima vangubi vakanyilile, vakahelela kumwani. Ukoya vakalongile vanu njowo chonda chevawonile kwa vala vanu vevakali na mahoka. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Suwe, vanu vonda va mwani wula vakahega vaka muheleliye Yesu, pevamwene vakamlongiye ahage muinyi lyawo.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akumunanicha munu munya lugaso</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maliko 2.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5.17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yesu akang'iye wato na kuhagama lihiva kuwuya peakali akwikala. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Baho, vanu vakamsindikile munu yumwi munya lugaso, agonichwe mukitefu. Yesu peawonile kudikila kwa vene, akamlongiye munu yula munya lugaso, “Mwana vangu wuyikangache! Ulekilwe sambi chako.” <verse eid="MAT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Vamonga va vawulanichi va malagilicho vakavangile kuhocha, “Uyu munu akumliga Nguluvi!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Ila Yesu akagachele mahocho gyawo, akavahuchile, “Wuli, muhocha mawofu munumbula chenu? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Nde liki kyekigehe kipefu kulonga, ‘Ulekilwe sambi chako awu kulonga,’ ‘Wime ugende?’ <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Ndeni ndisaka mchele kuva Mwana va Munu agehe na umwimike baha pa inyi va kuvawonela lusungu sambi.” Baho akamlongie uyo munu munya lugaso, “Wime, nyamule kitefu kyako na helele kukaye lyako!”<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Yula munu munya lugaso akaimile, akahela kukaye lyake. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Vanu vonda vevakali mulipinga pevawene ago, vakadudwive na kuwogofya, vakamnjumile Nguluvi yeavagavile vanu umwimike ngita ugo.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumkemela Matayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maliko 2.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5.27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu akahegile pala na peakali igenda, akamwene munu yumwi yeikemelwa Matayo mdumula usulu, ikalile paofisi. Suwe, Yesu akamlongiye, “Wache.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Matayo akaimile, akahelela kwa Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Yesu akahele kuliya kyakulya mukaye lya Matayo. Vakaingiye vadumula usulu volofu na vene sambi na kwikala pamwi na Yesu na vachulila vake. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Vafalisayo pevawene ago, vakavahuchile vachulila vake, “Wuli muwulanichi venu iliya pamwi na vadumula usulu vene sambi?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yesu akavapulikile, akalonga, “Vanu sevitamika sevakumkela mlami, ila vevakumkela mlami ndi vala vevitamika. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Ila muhelele mukayiwulaniche njowo ichi. ‘Ndisaka lusungu vala seusembe va kunyanya.’ Kwakuva sendachile kuvakemela vanu vanofu, ila vene sambi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu vakumuhucha Yesu njowo cha kuyikanila kuliya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maliko 2.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5.33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Baho, vachulila va Yohani mbatisa vakamuheleliye Yesu na kumuhucha, “Nefwe na Mafalisayo tuyikanila kuliya mala cholofu, kwa liki, vachulila vako seviyikanila kuliya?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesu avahigile, “Wuli, vagenji va mtwa va lihungu vavecha kukivilicha chipindi vagehe pamwi na mtwa va lihungu? Hamu! Ila chipindi chikwacha cha kuhechwa mtwa va lihungu pagati lyawo, baho nde vakwikanila kuliya.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“Vanu sevihonela kipapi kya mwenda mya mumwenda veusakiye. Kwakuva, kipapi ikyo kimya kidemula mwenda veusakiye na pala pepademwike pahongeleka.<figure style="fig" file="11 Unshrunk Patch.jpg" size="col" ref="9.16">Kipapi kidemula mwenda</figure> <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Kuhela vanu vevivika difwayi miya muliloboto lya ngwembe lihofu. Ngita davagita ndeni, liloboto lya ngwembe dalidemwika na difwayi isukuka, fyonda fidemwika likwanangika. Ila vanu uvika difwayi miya muliloboto lya ngwembe limiya na fyonda fivili, dafivecha unofu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwihinja va mpuga na maye yumwi vinanichwa.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maliko 5.21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8.40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Yesu peakali ilonga ago, mpuga yumwi Myahudi akafikile, amgundamile na kulonga, “Mwihinga vangu afue nondee. Ila chonde tuhelele ukamvikile liwoko lyako nave ivecha wumi.” <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yesu akahegile pamwi na vachulila vake, vakamfwatile.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Bahobaho, mdala yumwi yeakali na liholovela kwa chipindi cha miyaka kumi na givili, akachile kumbele lya Yesu, akambyalise mwenda vake. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Akagitile ndeni kwakuva akahochile munumbula lyake, “Pendimbyalisa hela mwenda vake, dandinana.” <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yesu akaseduka, peamwene akamlongiye, “Muhinja, unamache udikilo vako ukunaniche.” Bahobaho mdala akananile.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Yesu peafikile mukaye lya yula kilongochi va vapuga, akafikile na akawene vatova ngalapi na lipinga lya vanu likivilicha, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />akalongile, “Muhege baha! Muhinja uyu seakafuwe, avasile ng'ani.” Vene vakamuhekile. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Suwe, lipinga lya vanu pelihechilwe, Yesu akaingile mugati na kumkolela liwoko yula muhinja na akanamuka. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Njowo chila chikalutala muinyi yila yonda.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvananicha vanu vavili vagaya meho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Yesu akahegile baha na peakali igenda vanu vavili vagaya meho vakamfuatile kuno viyova, “Utuwonele lusungu Mwana va Dawudi!” <verse eid="MAT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Yesu peingile mukaya, vanu vavili vagaya meho, vakamuhelelie na mwene akavahuchile, “Wuli, mwikwidikila kuva ndivesa kuvagitila njowo ilyo?” Vene vakamhigile, “Ndakyene, Mtwa.” <verse eid="MAT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Baho, Yesu akagabyasile meho gyao, akalongile, “Iveche ngita pemukwidikila.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Meho gyao gakadinduliwa. Yesu akavakanile, “Mbihile kumlongela munu yeyonda njowo ichi.” <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Ila vene vakahegile, vakahele kulandula njowo cha Yesu muinyi ila yonda.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumnanicha munu yeseiwesa kuywanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Vanu avo vavili pevakali vahega, vanu vamonga vakamsindikile Yesu munu yumwi yeseiwesa kuywanga kwakuva akali na lihoka. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Bahobaho peahechile lihoka, munu yula seawesile kuywanga akavangile kuywanga. Lipinga lila lya vanu likadudwive na kulonga, “Njowo ngita ichi ndakyene sechikawonike Muisilaeli.” <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Ila Vafalisayo vakalongile “Uyu ihecha mihoka kwa umwimike va lihoka likomi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvawonela vanu lusungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yesu akagendile mwani gyonda na fijiji fyonda, akawulanicha mukaye chawo cha Nguluvi, idalika Njowo nofu cha ung'achale va Nguluvi na kuvananicha vatamwa na kila ayina lya fitamwa mugati mwa vanu. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Peawawene vanu vagehe mapinga mapinga, akavahonile lusungu kwakuva vafwahile hilo na vakali na wogofi ngita kondolo vevihela mkwamilaji. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Baho, akavalongiy e vachulila vake, “Mabenelo ndi gyolofu, ila vagita kasi nde vakefu. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Suwe, mumsuke yeagehe na mabenelo alagiliche vachulila vabene mabenelo gake.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalagilicha vachulila vake kumi na vavili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maliko 3.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6.12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yesu akuvalagilicha vachulila vake kumi na vavili, akavagavile umwimike vakudaga mihoka na kuvananicha vatamwa na uvawa vonda. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Matawa gya vanjagila kyumi na vavili ndi aga. Va kwanja ndi Simoni yeakemeliwe Peteli na Andelea lukolo vake, Yakobo mwana va Sebedayo na Yohani lukolo veke, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipo na Batolomeo na Tomasi na Matayo yeakali mdumula usulu na Yakobo mwana va Alifayo na Tadei, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simoni munu yeitovelela inyi lyake na Yuda Isikaliote yeamkanile Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kasi cha avo vanjagila va Yesu kyumi na vavili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maliko 6.7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9.1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yesu akavalagilicha vanjagila kyumi na vavili kuno akivalongela kuva, “Mubihile kuhelela kwa vanu se Vayawudi, vala mubihile kwingila mumwani va ku Vasamalia. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Ila muhelele kwa vanu Vaisilaeli vevayagile ngita kondoloo. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Pemuhelela kudalika, mukalonge kuva, ‘Ung'achale va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi ugehe pepi.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Muvananiche vatamwa, muvachulubule vanu vevafuwe, muvang'aliche vanu vene lukalavilo, muheche lihoka. Muvagavilwe hela na nyenye muheche hela. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Mubihile kunyamula mulufunga venu sahabu awu madini ga feza awu sendi cha saba. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Mubihile kunyamula muhako va lugendo vala koti lingi, vala makobasi vala lusagala. Kwakuva, mgita kasi ing'ang'wa kuhombwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />“Pemkwingila mwani vovonda awu kijiji kyokyonda, mumsake munu yeikela kuwanuka mwikale koya mbaka pemwihega pono baha. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Pemwingila mukaye yeyonda muvahungile vene kaye ndena, lutengamaso luveche kwa nyenye. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Ngita mwenekaye ing'ang'wa kuhungilwa ndeni, ila ngita kugehe na vanu vanofu mugati muvasukile Nguluvi avafunye, ila ngita kuhela Nguluvi daseakuvafunya vanu avo. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Ngita munu yeyonda ikana kuvawanuka awu kuvapulikicha, suwe, pemuhuma pakaye ilyo awu mwani ugo, mwipumune lifuna mumagulu gyenu. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela kigono kya luhigo, mwani ugo dawipata luhigo makomi kuchumba mwani gya Sodoma na Gomola.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Magudo gyegikwacha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maliko 13.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luka 21.12-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Mulolele, ndikuvalagilicha ngita kondolo pagati lya likeve. Ndena muveche na luhala ngita lyoka na vafokomasi ngita ng'unda. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Mwilolele na vanu, kwakuva davakuvasindika muludamo na kuvatova ndomondo mukaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Nyenye damwisindikwa pautalo lya vakomi na vang'achale kwa kunidikila nene, neke muvalongele undakyene njowo cha nene kwa vanu avo, pamwi na vanu se Vayawudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Suwe, pevakuvasindika nyenye muludamo, mubihile kuvecha na nyengema damwilonga liki awu mwikwitasa wuli, kwakuva bahobaho damgavilwa kya kulonga. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Kwakuva se nyenye damwilonga, ila ndi Muhe va Daada venu daivecha ilonga kuchumbila nyenye.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />“Lukolo daakumkana lukolo vake adochwe na daada daakumkana mwana vake na vana davakuvatova vasasi vawo na kuvagita vadochwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Vanu vonda davakuvavipila nyenye kwa kunidikila nene. Ila daihuvulila mbaka kumwiso, nde dailowolwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />“Vanu pevakuvagudisa mumwani wumwi, munyilile mumwani wungi. Ndakyene, ndikuvalongela, semwimala mwani gya Isilaeli ngajila Mwana va Munu kwacha.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Muwulanichwa seakumchumba muwulanichi vake, vala muwulanichwa seakumchumba mtwa vake. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Muwulanichwa ing'ang'wa kuvecha ngita muhulanichi vake na mnyigendwa ing'ang'wa kuvecha ngita mtwa vake. Ngita nene mkomi venu vanikemeliye Belisebuli, wuli nyenye dasemwikemelwa matawa mawofu hilo?<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeing'ang'wa kuwogofya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luka 12.2-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Suwe, mbihile kuvawogofya vanu avo. Kila kyekigubikilwe dakigubulilwa na kila kyekifyamilwe dakiwoneka. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Suwe, kyendikuvalongela nyenye pono pahela vanu, muvalongele vanu. Njowo chempulikile mulipepwa, muchilandule pa vanu. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Mubihile kuvawogofya vala vevidocha muvili, ila seviwesa kuidocha muhe. Mwing'ang'wa kumuwogofya Nguluvi yeiwesa kuhananga muvili pamwi na muhe mulyoto lya mumafunde. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Vakamdunduli vavili huguchwa kwa sendi imwi. Ila ata yumwi seiguwa panyi ngajila daada vawo kuchela. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Ata Nguluvi ichela chigehe chiliga fwili cha fituwe fyenu. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Ndeni, mubihile kuwogofya, nyenye ndi ngiba hilo pautalo lya Nguluvi kuchumba avo vadunduli volofu.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumudikila na kumlema Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:8">Luka 12.8</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:9">9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Munu yeyonda yeakunidikila pautalo lya vanu kuva mwene nde vangu na nene dandikumudikila pautalo lya Daada vangu yeagehe kuluhano. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Ila yeyonda yeakunikana pautalo lya vanu na nene dandikumkana pautalo lya Daada vangu yeagehe kuluhano.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sendikaletile lutengamaso, ila fita</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka 12.51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26">14.26</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:27">27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Mbihile kuhocha kuva ndachile kuvaletela ludikilo pa inyi. Sendachile kuvaletela ludikilo ila ndachile kuchovelecha ndewo. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Kwakuva ndachile kuvaletela ndeo pagati lya mwana na daada vake na muhinja na maye vake na mukwive na mganafu vake. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Mchundwama va munu ndi vanu va kaye lyake.<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“Yeakumkela daada awu maye vake kuchumba peakunikela nene, seawesa kuvecha mchulila vangu, yeakumkela mwana awu muhinja kugina nene, seawesa kuvecha mchulila vangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Munu yeseinyamula kipindilihicho kyake na kwacha kwa nene, seawesa kuvecha mchulila vangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Mwene yeakela kuwunanicha uwumi vake akuwuyagicha, ila yeawuyagicha uwumi vake kwakuva lya nene mwene dakugalowola.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daveviwanuka fupo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:41">Maliko 9.41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Yeyonda yeakuvawanuka nyenye mukaye lyake, akuniwanuka nene mukaye lyake na yeakuniwanuka nene, akumhanuka yula yeanilagiliche. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Yeyonda yeakumwanuka mvichi va Nguluvi kwakuva nde mvichi, iwanuka fupo lya uvichi. Yeyonda yeakumwanuka munu yeigita manofu pautalo lya Nguluvi kwakuva nde munu yeigita manofu pautalo lya Nguluvi, daiwanuka fupo lya munu yeigita manofu pautalo lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, yeyonda yeakumgavila yumwi va vadodo ava kikombe kya malenga gachichimu kwakuva nde mchulila vangu, ndakyene ipata fupo lyake.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Njowo kuhuma kwa Yohani mbatisa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka 7.18-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Yesu peamalile kuvalagilicha vachulila kumi na vavili, baho akahegile, akahele kuwulanicha na kudalika mumwani gyao ku Galilaya.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Yohani yeibatisa peakali mukiwopo akapulike makani gyeakali igita Kilisito. Ndeni, Yohani akavalagilicha vanyigendwa vake vahelele kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />Vakamuhuche, “Wuli, veve ndi yula yeikwacha awu tumchinde yungi?” <verse eid="MAT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu akavahigile, “Muhelele mkamlongele Yohani makani gyemupulika na kugalola. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Vanu vagaya meho vilola, vatenda vigenda, vene ukalavilo vananichwa, vadinda matu vapulika, vevafuwe vichulubuchwa na vahangala vidalikilwa Njowo nofu. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Afunyilwe munu yula yeasekunivipila nene.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Suwe, vala vachulila va Yohani pevakali vihega, Yesu akavangile kugalongela mapinga gya vanu njowo cha Yohani, “Mukahele kulola liki ukoya kuwelu? Wuli, mukali mukela kulola lidete lyelihogoseka na lukala? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Suwe, mukahele kulola liki? Mukahele kumulola munu yeafwalile myenda minofu? Vanu vefifwala myenda minofu vakwikala mukaye cha vang'achale. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Suwe, mukahele kulola liki? Wuli, mukahele kumulola mvichi va Nguluvi? Ena, ndakyene mukahele kumlola munu yeagehe mkomi kuchumba mvichi va Nguluvi.<verse eid="MAT 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />“Uyo nde yeasimbilwe mumasimbo gya Nguluvi, ‘Lole, nene ndikumlagilicha mnanzi vangu akulongole, mwene daigalanicha ng'asi lyako.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, mugati lya vanu vonda yevakalile muinyi, kuhela yewonike kuva mkomi kuchumba Yohani mbatisa. Ata ndeni, yula yeakali mdodo hilo muung'achale va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, ndi mkomi kuchumba Yohani. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Kuhuma chipindi cha Yohani mbatisa mbaka neng'uli, ung'achale va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi upatikana kwa kutumila ludali hilo, vanu vene ludali vigecha kunyamula kwa ludali. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Kwakuva vavichi vonda na malagilicho ga Nguluvi geamgavile Musa vakalaguwe njowo cha ung'achale va Nguluvi dachivecha mbaka chipindi ichi. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Ngita mwivesa kwidikila kyevalaguwe, suwe Yohani nde Elia yealaguliwe kuva ngaikwacha. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Mwene masigicha na apulike.<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Suwe, dandikiwananisa na liki kilelo iki? Ndi ngita vadimi vevikalile palembuka na kuvakemela veyawo na kuvalongela, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‘Tuvatovile ngoma ila semkakinile!’ Twimbile lusambo lwa kusungwima ila semukakiviliche! <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Kwakuva Yohani akaachila, akayikanile kulya na vala seanyuwe difai, navo vakalongile. ‘Agehe na lihoka.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Mwana va Munu akaachile, ilya na kunyuwa na vene vakalongile. ‘Mumlole uyu, ikela kulya hilo na mgalaji, mganja va vadumula usulu na vene sambi!’ Ata ndeni, uginyange va Nguluvi iwonisile kuva ndi nofu kuchumbila magito gyake.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwani gya vanu sevakudikila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka 10.13-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Baho, Yesu avangile kuilonga mwani gyeagitile umanyitu golofu kuchumba kungi, kwakuva vanu vake sevakahongiche sambi chawo. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Dawilola veve Kolazini! Dawilola veve Betisaida! Kwakuva ngita umanyitu veugitile kwa nyenye ngaigitilwe kula Tilo na Sidoni, vanu vake ngavavalile myenda gya maloboto suwe na kwibaka kifu neke kuwonesa kuva vahongiche. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Ata ndeni, ndikuvalongela, kigono kya kuhiga nongwa, nyenye damwipata magudo makomi kuchumba vanu va mwani va Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Na nyenye vanu va Kapelanaumu, wuli damwinamulwa mbaka kuluhano kwa Nguluvi? Hamu! Damukwiswa mbaka muinyi lya vanu vevafuwe! Kwakuva ngita umanyitu gyegitile paveve ngaigitilwe ukoya Sodoma, mwani ugo ngaugehe mbaka neng'uli. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Ila ndikuvalongela, kigono kya kuhiga veve wipata magudo makomi kuchumba lya Sodoma.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwache kwa nene mutulule</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luka 10.21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Chipindi ikyo Yesu akalongile, “Ndikuhongecha Daada, Mtwa va kuluhano na inyi, kwakuva uvafihile vene uginyange na vene luhala njowo ichi na kuvagubutulia vadodo. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Ena, ndeni nde peukeliye Daada vangu.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />“Daada vangu anigavile finu fyonda. Kwihela yeamchela Mwana ila Daada, vala yeamchelie Daada ila Mwana na munu yeyonda yula Mwana ikela kumgubutulila amchele Daada. <verse eid="MAT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />Mwache kwa nene nyenye vonda nyemufwaile kwa kunyamula michigo, nene ndikuvatulicha. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Mudikile kulongochwa na nene ngita fila ng'ambako yeawopilwe ligongolo, na nyenye mwiwulaniche kuhuma kwa nene kwakuva nene nde mfokomasi na myigafu na nyenye mwipolechwa munumbula chenu. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Kwakuva daivecha upefu kwa nyenye kuvalongocha nyenye kwakuva mawulanichi gyangu semakangafu.” <figure style="fig" file="13 Yoke.jpg" size="col" ref="11.30">Senga vavili vevawopilwe kingongola pasingo</figure><verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Mtwa va Kigono kya Kutulula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maliko 2.23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6.1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Chipindi icho, Yesu akali ichumba mumigunda gya ngano kigono kya kutulila. Suwe, vachulila vake vakali na njala, vakavangile kubena mahocho gya ngano na kulya mbeyu chake. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Vafalisayo pevalolile ago, vakamlongiye Yesu, “Lole, vachulila vako vigita njowo chechikanwa kugitwa mu Kigono kya Kutulula.” <verse eid="MAT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yesu akavahigile, “Wuli, semwimbile kyeagitile Dawudi pamwi na veyage pevakali na njala? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Mwene akaingila mukaye lya Nguluvi akaliye mibumunda gyegivikilwe pautalo lya Nguluvi, ila seing'ang'ilwe kuliya na vanu vovonda vala, ila vatekechi hela veving'ang'wa kuliya. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Awu semwimbile mukiganulo kya malagilicho ga Nguluvi geamgavile Musa kuva kila Kigono kya Kutulula, vatekechi videnya malagilicho mukaye lya Nguluvi, ila seviwoneka kuva ndi nongwa? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Suwe, ndikuvalongela kuva yeagehe mkomi kuchumba kaye lya Nguluvi agehe baha. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Ngita ngamuchela njowo ichi. Ndisaka lusungu vala seusembe, sengamuvahigile vanu ava. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Kwakuva, Mwana va Munu agehe na umwimike mu Kigono kya Kutulula.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumnanicha munu munya liwoko lugaso</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maliko 3.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6.6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yesu akahegile baho, akahele mukaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Mumo, kukali na munu yumwi munya liwoko lugaso. Suwe, vanu vakamuhuchile Yesu, “Wuli, ndi ngiba kumnanicha munu Kigono kya Kutulula?” Vakamuhuchile ndeni neke vawese kumlata.<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Ila Yesu akavalongiye, “Tulonge, yumwi venu agehe na kondolo vake yeagwilile mulilindi, wuli, seukumbata na kumuhecha umo kigono kya kutulila? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Ila, munu ndingiba hilo kuchumba kondolo! Suwe, ndi ngiba kugita manofu Kigono kya Kutulula.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Baho, akamlongile yula munu, “Konjolole liwoko lyako.” Akakonjolola, nago wukali unanile ukali ngita wula wungi. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Suwe, Vafalisayo vakahumile kwivala, vakalongine vakumudocha wuli Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mnjagila yeahuguliwe na Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Ila Yesu peachelila njowo icho, akahegile pono baho. Vanu volofu vakamfwatile, akavananiche vatamwa vonda, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />kuno, akavakanile vala vevananichwe vabihile kuvalongela vanu njowo chake, <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Yesu akalongile gala neke katimile gala gyealongile Nguluvi kwa ng'asi lya mvichi Isaya, <verse eid="MAT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Lole mnjagila yungi ndimuhaguwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">mwana vangu yendimkeliye munumbula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Ndikuivika numbula lyangu pakyanya lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">mwene dailanducha gala geandikugakela vanu vagite muinyi yonda.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Daseilumbana vala kutova kyowo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">vala kyoo lyake selipulikika mung'asi.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Lidenge lye libochwike selidenyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">vala utambi veuhumicha lyosi seuchimika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">mbaka lihigo lya gala geakela gagitwe.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Kwa mwene, vanu va inyi yonda davakumuhuvilila.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belisebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maliko 3.20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11.14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Baho, vanu vakamsindikile Yesu munu yumwi mgaya meho na akali seivesa talonga kwakuva akali na lihoka. Yesu akamnaniche na akawesile kuywanga na kulola. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Lipinga lyonda lya vanu likadudwive likalonga, “Wuli, uyu se mwana va Dawudi?” <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Ila Vafalisayo pevapulike ago, vakalonga, “Munu uyu akuvadaga mahoka kwa umwimike va Belisebuli uyu nde mkomi va mahoka.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Yesu peachelile mahocho gyao, akavalongiye, “Ung'achale wowonda weugavanyike mapinga mapinga gyegitovana, seuwesa kwikala na mwani wowonda awu vanu vovonda vevagawanyike mapinga mapinga gyegitovana, dagiguwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Ngita Setani akumdaga Setani, ung'achale vake uvecha ugawanyike. Wuli, ung'achale vake seuwesa kwendelela? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Nyenye mwilonga ndidaga mahoka kwa umwimike va Belisebuli, wuli, vachulila venu vakuvadaga mahoka kwa umwimike va ani? Kwakuva, avo davakuvahiga nyenye. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Ila ngita ndikuvadaga mahoka kwa umwimike va Muhe va Nguluvi, suwe, muchele kuva ung'achale va Nguluvi ufikile suwe kwa nyenye.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />“Awu, ivesa wuli munu kwingila mukaye lya munu mwene ludali na kumnyaga finu fyake ngita seamuhopile tandi? Baho, nde iwesa kumnyanga finu fyake.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />“Yeyonda yeabihila kuvecha pamwi na nene, akunipinja na yeyonda yeseilundasa pamwi na nene, suwe uyo ihaganicha. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Ndeni, ndikuvalongela, vanu davawonelwa lusumgu sambi na maligo gyawo, ila daikumliga Muhe va Nguluvi uyo dasewonelwa lusungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Kangi yeilonga njowo cha kumpinja Mwana va Munu, daiwonelwa lusungu, ila yula yeipinja njowo cha Muhe va Nguluvi, daseiwonelwa lusungu, vala muinyi iyi vala muinyi veukwacha.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libiki na manunu gyake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luka 6.43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Muligite libiki livecha linofu na manunu gyake givecha ganofu, mugite kuvecha mawofu na manunu gyake givecha mawofu. Libiki lichelwa kwa manunu gyake. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Nyenye kilelo kya lyoka! Muvecha wuli kulonga njowo chinofu kuno nyenye vawofu? Kwakuva, munu ilonga kuhuma gyegimemile munumbula. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Munu munofu ulonga njowo chinofu kuhuma munumbula lyake na munu muwofu ilonga njowo chiwofu kuhuma munumbula lyake.<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />“Ila ndikuvalongela, mukigono kya luhigo, vanu davihumicha luvalilo mumakani gyao gyonda gya upufi gyevilonga. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Kwakuva munjowo chako dauwoneka mnofu pautalo lya Nguluvi na kwa gala gyeulonga, dauhigwa kuva na nongwa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kimanyilo kya Yoha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Maliko 8.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka 11.29-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Pambele vamonga va vawulanichi va malagilicho na Vafalisayo vakamlongiye Yesu, “Muhulanichi, tusaka utugitile kimanyilo ngita ndakyene wihuma kwa Nguluvi.” <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Yesu akavahigile, “Kilelo kiwofu sekimudikila Nguluvi! Mwisaka kimanyilo, ila dasemwigavilwa kimanyilo kyokyonda, ila kimanyilo kya mvichi Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Ngita Yona peakalile mulisololo lya somba yeikemelwa nyangumi figono fidatu, palumiye na pamiye, ndeni na Mwana va Munu daakwikala panyi lya inyi figono fidatu pamilau na pamiye. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Kigono kya kuhiga nongwa vanu va Ninewi davahumila na davavecha pamwi na vanu va kilelo iki na kukihiga nongwa kilelo iki, kwakuva Vaninewi vakahongiche mumadaliko gya Yona. Na nondee agehe mkomi kuchumba Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Kigono kya kuhiga nogwa, Mdala va ng'achale va Sheba daihumila na mwene dakuhiga kilelo iki. Kwakuva mwene akagendile kuhuma muinyi lyake kutali neke apulike njowo cha uginyange cha Solomoni na baha agehe mkomi kuchumba Solomoni.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya kwa lihoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luka 11.24-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Lihoka pelihuma kwa munu, lichungutilachungutila pono pepahela malenga, isaka pono pakutulula, ila seakupapatila. <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />Baho, ilonga, ‘Dandiwuya mukaye lyangu pendikahumile.’ Ila peiwuya kangi mukaye yila payilola yifyagilwe na kulembechwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Baho, uhelela na kuvanyamula mahoka gingi saba, vawofu hilo kuchumba mwene na vene vakwingila na vikala kwa munu uyo. Suwe, munu uyo ivecha muwofu kuchumba pamwandi. Ndeni nde peivecha pa vanu ava vawofu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo va undakyene va Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maliko 3.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8.19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yesu peakali iywanga na lipinga lya vanu, maye vake na lukolo vake vakafikile na kwima kwivala, vakasakile kuywanga na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Suwe, munu yumwi akamlongiye Yesu, “Mtwa maye vako na lukolo vako vagehe kwivala, vasaka kuywanga na veve.” <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Ila Yesu akamhigile yula munu, “Maye vangu nde ani? Lukolo vangu nde va ani?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Baho, akavagonjolela liwoko lyake vachulila vake, akalonga, “Ava nde maye vangu na lukolo vangu! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Kwakuva yeyonda yeigita yeakela Daada vangu yeagehe kuluhano, uyo nde lukolo vangu, mhacha vangu na maye vangu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Mufanu va mvyala mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maliko 4.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8.4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Kigono kikila Yesu akahumile mukaye yila na ikaliye mng'umbong'umbo lya inyanza. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Lipinga likomi lya vanu likamuchungutile, Yesu akakang'ie muwato na ikalile na vanu vonda vakahimile mung'umbung'umbu lya lihiva, <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />mwene Yesu akavalongiye njowo cholofu kwa mufano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Mpulikiche! Mgima akahele kuvyala mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Peakali ivyala mbeyu mumgunda, chingi chikaguwe mung'asi, fidege fyachile na kuliya. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Chingi chikaguwe pa mganga veugehe pakyanya lya liganga. Chikamelile kisatu kwakuva mganga ukali sewolofu. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Pelihomue lichuwa, chika gamile kwakuva midadikwa gyake gikali segikahikile panyi. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Chingi chikaguwe pamibiki gya mihomi, nagyo mihomi gikakulile na kugikekenecha mimelo. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Mbeyu chingi chikaguwe pamganga munofu, mimelo gyake chikababile, chingi miya imwi, chingi sitini na chingi selasini.”<verse eid="MAT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Yesu akamalile kwa kulonga, “Yeagehe na masigichi na apulike!”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Natilo lya kuwulanicha kwa mifanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maliko 4.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9">Luka 8.9</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:10">10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Vachulila vake vakamuhelelie, vakamuhuchile, “Wuli ulonga na vanu kwa mifanu?” <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Yesu akavahigile, “Nguluvi avagavile nyenye umwimike va kuchichela lupwepo lya Ung'achale vake, ila ava Nguluvi seakavagitile vachele ago gyonda. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Kwakuva, munu yeyonda yeachela ung'achale va kuluhano, Nguluvi dakumgita kuchela hilo, ila munu yeyonda yeseichela kutigila ung'achale va kuluhano, Nguluvi dakukihecha ata kila kidodo kyeakukichela. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Ndilonga navo kwa mifanu, kwakuva vilolela gyendikugagita ila vakwigita sevilola, vipulikicha kyendiwulanicha ila vakwigita sevipulika, vala sevichela. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Kwavene gatimile gala gyealongie mvichi Isaya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Kupulika mwipulika, ila semwipulika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">Kulola mwilola, ila mubihile kulola.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Kwakuva luwala va vanu ava chipwemwike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">vadindile msigichi gyao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">vadindile meho gyao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Vabihile kulola kwa meho gyao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ngavapulike kwa msigichi gyao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ngavachele kwa luhala vao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">na kunisedukila, ilonga Mtwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">nene nganivananiche.’<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />“Yesu akalongile kangi mfunyilwe nyenye, kwakuva meho gyenu gilola na masigichi gyenu gipulika. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, vavichi na vanu vasanzi volofu vakadobwike kugalola gala gyemkugalola nyenye, ila sevakagawene na vakadobwike kupulika gala gyemugapulika, ila sevakapulike.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ihumulila mufanu va mvyala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maliko 4.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8.11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Suwe, nyenye mupilike mufano va yula munu yeakahele kuvyala mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Munu yeyonda yeipulika njowo lya ung'achale va Nguluvi ngajila kuchela awana na chila mbeyu chechiguwe mng'asi. Yula mwofu ikwacha na kunyamula kila kyekivalilwe mnumbula lyake. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Ila mbeyu yeigwiliye mganga pakyanya lya liganga ndi mufano va munu yeipulika njowo lya Nguluvi na kulianuka kwa lukelo. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Ila seligehe na midadikwa mugati lyake, likwikala kwa ludodo, chipindi kya magudo awu lumyayo pefihumila kwakuva lya njowo ilyo, ikumgita aleke kumdikila Nguluvi. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Ila mbeyu yeiguwe pamibiki gya mihomi, ndi mufano va munu yeipulika njowo, ila nyengema cha inyi iyi na ludoboka lwa kuvecha na finu fyolofu hulikekenecha njowo, nave seibaba manunu. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Ila mbeyu yeivyalilwe pamganga mnofu nde mufano va munu yeipulika njowo na kuchela, nalyo hubaba manunu, yumwi mia, yungi sitini na yungi selasini.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luwano lwa misapi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yesu akavalongie vanu mufano wungi, “Ung'achale va kuluhano uwana na munu yeavyalile mbeyu chinofu pamgunda vake. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Ila vanu pevagonile, muchwindama vake akachile, akavyalile mitendya pagati lya mipunga, akahele. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Suwe, mimelo peimelile na kuvanga kuhomola, mitendya nagyo gakavanga kuwoneka. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Vachulila va yula mwene mgunda vakamuhelelile, vakamlongiye, ‘Mkomi, seukavyalile mbeyu nofu mumgunda vako. Nondee mitendya gihumila kwiya?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Mwene akavahigile, ‘Mchwindwama nde yeagitile ago.’ Suwe, vachulila vake vakamuhuchila, ‘Wuli, wisaka twelele tukagakule?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Nave akavahigile, ‘Hamu, mbihile kugakula mitendya, kwakuva pemuvecha mukula mitendya muvecha kukula na mipunga. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Muleke ikule pamwi mbaka chipindi kya mabenelo. Chipindi icho ndikuvalongela vabenaji. Mulundase tandi mitendya na mugawope filundofilundo na kunyanywa. Ila mipunga muilundase mkaivike mulusanja vangu.’”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufano va mbeyu yeikemelwa haladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maliko 4.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13.18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yesu akavalongie vanu mufano wungi, “Ung'achale va kuluhano uwana na mbeyu yeikemelwa haladali yeahechile munu yumwi, akavyalile mumgunda vake. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Mbeyu yene ndi ndodo kuchumba mbeyu chonda, ila peimela daivecha umelo mkomi kuchumba mimelo gyonda na kangi daivecha mkomi ngita libiki na fidege vakwacha na kuchenga mumakwati gyake.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufanu va amila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luka 13.20-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yesu akavalongiye mufano wungi, “Ung'achale va kuluhano uwanine na amila yeanyamuwe maye yumwi, ahanganyise na utine va ngano lidebe chivili na nusu, ata utine wonda ukatupile.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wuli Yesu ilonga kwa mifanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Maliko 4.33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yesu akavalongiye mapinga ga vanu ago gyonda kwa mifanu, seavalongiye kyekyonda ngajila kulonga kwa mifanu. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Agitile ndeni neke njowo chealongile vavichi chitimile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">“Ndiywanga na nyenye kwa mifanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">dandikuvalongela makani segavachele kuhuma peihumbilwe inyi.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ihumulila mifanu gya misapi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Baho, Yesu akavalekile vala vanu, akaingile mukaye. Vachulila vake vakamuhelelie vakamlongie, “Utulongele ula mufano va mitendya ga mumgunda.” <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yesu aka valongiye, “Mvyalaji va chila mbeyu chinofu nde mwana va munu. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Ula mgunda nde inyi. Chila mbeyu chinofu ndi vanu vala ambavo ung'achale nde vawo, ila gila mitendya ndi vala vanu va yula muwofu. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Mchwindama yeavyalile chila mitendeya ndi Setani. Mabenelo nde mwiso va chipindi na vabenaji nde vandumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Suwe, ngita pemulola pemulundasa mitendya na kunyanywa lyoto, ndeni daivecha mwiso va inyi. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwana va Munu akuvalagilicha vandumindumi vake na vene davalundasa kuhuma muung'achale vake na vala vonda vevakuvagita vanu vangi vagite sambi na vonda vevagita sambi, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />na kuvataga mulitanuli lya lyoto na ukoya davivemba na kusiginya mino kwa uwafi mkomi. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Ila vala vevagitile gala gegakumkelesa Nguluvi, davang'ala ngita lichuwa muung'achale va Daada vao. Mwene masigicha na apulike!<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufanu va umosi veufyamile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Ung'achale va kuluhano uwanine na lusanja veufiamile kumgunda. Munu yumwi akauwene, akafihile kangi. Akakeduka hilo akahele kugucha finu fyonda fye agehe nafyo, akagulile mgunda wula.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufanu va lulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Kangi, ung'achale va kuluhano uwana na mguchaji yumwi yeisaka lulu yimwi nofu. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Peapatile lulu yimwi yeigehe na senti ngomi, akahelela kugucha fyonda fyeanafyo na kugula lulu yila.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufanu va nyafu lya kulowolela somba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Kangi, Ung'achale va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi uwana na valowa somba vevakumbile wafu vawo muinyanza ukagomiche somba va kila ayina. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Peumemile, valowa vakakwegile kumuhanga, vikalile na kulundasa somba vanofu na kuvavika mundilu na vawofu vakatagile. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Ndeni, ivecha chipindi cha mwiso cha inyi ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi davikwacha na kuvanenga vanu vanofu na vanu vawofu, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />na kuvataga avo vawofu mulitanuli lya liwoto. Ukoya vivemba na kusigina mino.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lusanja lumiya na kuukuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yesu akahuchile, “Wuli, mchichele njowo ichi chonda? Vakahigile, ena tuchichele.” <verse eid="MAT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Nave akavalongiye, “Suwe, kila muwulanichi va lulagilicho lya Musa yeagavilwe na Nguluvi yeivecha mchulila va ung'achale va kuluhano uwana na mwene kaya yeihecha palusanja vake finu miya na kuukuu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ikanwa ukoya Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maliko 6.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4.16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Yesu peamalile kulonga mifanu igyo akahegile pono baha, <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />akaelela kukijiji kyake. Ukoya akali akuvawulanicha vanu mukaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi ata vakadudwive, vakalonga, “Munu uyu apatile kwiya uginyange na umwimike uwu va kugita umanyitu.” <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Wuli, uyu se yula mwana va muhongola mibiki? Maye vake se yula yeikemelwa Malia na lukolo vake se Yakobo na Yosefu na Simoni na Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Na vahacha vake vonda sevakwikala baha pamwi na nefwe? Munu uyu apatile kwiya njowo ichi chonda? <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Vakamkanile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Ila Yesu akavalongiye, “Ng'achale iginywa kila pono, ila seiginywa muinyi lyake na mukaye lyake.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Ndeni, seagitile umanyitu gyolofu kwakuva sevakumwidikila.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Kufuwa kwa Yohani mbatisa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maliko 6.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9.7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Chipindi ikyo ng'achale Helode yeakali mtavala va Galilaya akapulike njowo nofu cha Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Suwe, akavalongie vanyigendwa vake, “Munu uyu ndi Yohana mubatisa, achulubwike na agehe na ludali cha kugita njowo cha umanyitu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Helode nde akambatile Yohani, akamwopile ndegeyi cha kyuma mukihopo, kwakuva lya Helodia, mdala va Filipo, lukolo vake. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Kwakuva Yohani akamlongie Helode kuva, “Seunofu veve kuvecha na mdala Helodia.” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Helode akang'ang'ile kumudocha Yohani, ila akaogwipe vanu kwakuva kwavene, Yohani akali mvichi va Nguluvi.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Kigono kimwe palihungu lya kwiwuka kubabwa kwa Helode, muhinja va Helodia akakinile pautalo lya vagenji mbaka Helode akakeduke hilo, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />na Helode akajangile kwa kwilapa kumgavila uyo mhinja kyokyonda kyeikela. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Nave, akahovelechwa na maye vake, akasukile, “Ndigavile baha muluwelo kituwe kya Yohani Mbatisa.” <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Ng'achale akasugwime hilo, ila kwakuva lya kilapo kyake na kwakuva lya vala vagenji pa lihungu, akaswitiliche agavilwe. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Suwe, Helode akamlagiliche munu mukiwopo amudumule mutuwe Yohani. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Kituwe kya Yohani kikaletilwe muluwelo, vakamgavile yula mhinja, na mwene akamsindikile maye vake. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Vachulila va Yohani vakachile, vakaunyamuwe mvili vake, vakausila. Baho vakahelile kumlongela Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvagavila kyakula vanu elufu chihanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliko 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohani 6.1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Yesu peapulike njowo chechimuhumile Yohani mbatisa, akahegile pono ipo kwa wato, akahelela pono pekwihela vanu. Ila vanu vakapulike njowo icho, vakamfwatile kwa kugenda kwa magulu kuhuma mimwani. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Suwe, peikile kwivindi, akavawene vanu volofu hilo, akawaonela lusungu, akavananiche matamwa gyawo.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Peifikikle palumiye, vachulila vake vakamuheleliye na vakamlongiye, “Pono ipa ndi kudasi na muda usilile. Suwe, uvalage vanu neke vahelele mufijiji vakagule kyakula kyawo.” <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yesu akavalongiye, “Mubihile kuveleka vahege, muvagavile nyenye kyakula.” <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Ila vawo vakamlongiye, “Tugehe na mibumunda gihanu na somba vavili hela.” <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yesu akavalongiye, “Muniletele baha.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Akavalongiye vanu vakale pasi mumisoli. Baho, Yesu akanyamula gila mibuminda gihanu na somba vavili, akalolile kuluhano akavifunyila na kuiketula gila mibumunda, akavagavile vachulila vake mibumunda igo na vachulila vake vakavagavila avo vanu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Vanu vonda vakaliye, vakagwita na vachulila vake vakalundasa fyevisigaliye vakamemiche findilu kumi na chivili. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Vanu vevaliye vakali vagosi elufu chihanu, ila vadala na vana sevavalilwe.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu igenda pamalenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliko 6.45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohani 6.15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Suwe, Yesu akavalongile vachulila vake vakang'ale muwato valongole kuhelela kumwambo lya lihiva, mwene akali akuvalaga vanu. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Peamalile kuvalaga vanu, akahelela weka kukidunda kufunya. Peifikile palumiye, Yesu akali ukoya yumwene, <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />na chipindi ikyo wato ukali uhelele pepi na ng'umbung'umbu lya lihiva, ila kukali na utumama kwakuva lukala ukali upuga wato. <verse eid="MAT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Pamiye pepi na kukiya, Yesu akavaheleliye vachulila kuno igenda pamalenga. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Vachulila vake pevamuwene igenda pamalenga vakaogwipe hilo, vakalongile, “Lingasaga!” Vakatovile kyowo kwa uwogofi. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Bahobaho Yesu akavalongile, “Muchike, ndi nene. Mubihile kwogofya!” <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Peteli akamlongiye, “Mtwa ngita veve ndakyene ndongele ndigende pamalenga ndache kwa veve.” <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yesu akalonga, “Wache.” Suwe, Peteli akaikile muwato, akagendile pamalenga akahelela kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Ila peauwene lula lukala, akaogwipe, akavanga kudibala, akavembile, “Mtwa, unitange!” <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Suwe, Yesu akakonjolala liwoko lyake, akamkolela na kumlongela, “Veve ugehe na ludikilo ludodo! Wuli, ukaogwipe?” <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Suwe, vakakang'ala wato na lukala ukaleka kupuga. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Vonda vevakali muwato vakamgundamila, vakalongile, “Ndakyene veve nde Mwana va Nguluvi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvananaicha vatamwa ukoya Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maliko 6.53-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Pevahagime lihiva, vakafikile inyi lya Genesaleti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Vanu va ukoya pevamchele kuva mwene ndi Yesu, suwe vakamusindikile Yesu vatamwa vonda, <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />vakamsuka Yesu abihile kuvakanila kubyalisa hela lubindo lwa mwenda vake. Na vene vevabyalise vakananile.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Mawulanicho gya valongochi vetu vadaha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maliko 7.1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Suwe, Vafalisayo na vawulanichi va malagilicho gya Nguluvi gyeamgavile Musa vakafikile kuhuma ku Yelusalemu, vakamuheleliye Yesu, vakamuwucha, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Kwa liki, vachulila vako sevidikila mawulanicho chetuwanuke kwa valongochi vetu vadaha? Sevikalawa mawoko ngita peing'ang'wa pevisaka kuliya!” <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu akavahigile, “Kwa liki, nyenye mwidenya lagicho lya Nguluvi mwidikila mawulanichi gyenu vavene? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Kwakuva Nguluvi akalongile, ‘Mvaginye daada vako na maye vako na munu yeyonda yeakumliga daada vake awu maye vake, daidochwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Ila nyenye mwiwulanichwa kuva munu, ngita munu agehe na kinu ngaivesa kumtanga daada vake awu maye vake, ila akilonga Kinu iki kya Nguluvi, <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />suwe, mwilonga munu seing'ang'wa kumuginya daada vake kwa kumtanga kumgavila kinu ikyo! Ndeni mukulibeda luchowo lya Nguluvi kwa kufuwata mawulanichi gyenu vavene. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Nyenye vafyangu! Mvichi Isaya akalagule undakyene njowo chenu kuva,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />‘Nguluvi ilonga, vanu ava vakuniginya kwa kuywanga hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">Ila munumbula chao vagehe kutali na nene.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Kufunya kwavo seikuvatanga kinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">kwakuva viwulanicha malagilicho gyegihuma kwa vanu vakihocha kuva ndi mawulanicho gegihuma kwa Nguluvi.’”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Finu fyefikumgita munu abihile kudikilwa kuvecha pautalo lya Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Maliko 7.14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Yesu akalikemeliye lila lipinga lya vanu, akavalongiye, “Mpulikiche na muchele! <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Kyekimugita munu abihile kwidikilwa kuvecha pautalo lya Nguluvi sekimwingila mumlomo, ila njowo chiwofu chechikumuhuma mumlomo. Ago nde gakumgita munu abihile kwidikilwa kuvecha pautalo lya Nguluvi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Suwe, vachulila vakamuheleliye na vakamulongiye, “Wuli, wichela kuva Vafalisayo vakavipile pevapulike njowo cheukalongile?” <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Ila mwene akavahigile, “Kinu kyokyonda sekivyalilwe na Daada vangu yeagehe kuluhano dawikulwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Muvaleke! Vene ndi vagaya meho na vilongochwa na vagaya meho. Ngita mgaya meho akumlongocha muyage mgaya meho, vonda vavili davigwilia mulilindi.” <verse eid="MAT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Peteli akalongile, “Tugalanulile mufano ugu.” <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu akalonga ata nyenye semwichela? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Wuli, semwichela kuva kila kyekikwingila mulomo huelela mukisololo na pambele kukihecha muchowo? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Ila makani gyegihuma mumlomo gihuma munumbula, ago nde gyegikumgita munu abihile kwidikilwa kuvecha pautalo lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Kwakuva munumbula kuhuma mawocho mawofu gyegikumlongocha munu kudocha na kugita ugoni na nakugita usalati kugita uhichi na kugita udesi na kuliga. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Ago nde gakumugita munu abihile kwidikilwa kuvecha pautalo lya Nguluvi. Ila kulya kyakula ngajila kukalawa mawoko segakumgita munu abihile kwidikilwa kuvecha pautalo lya Nguluvi.<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudikila kwa maye Mkananayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maliko 7.24-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yesu akahegile pono baha akahele muinyi chechigehe pepi na mwani cha Tilo na Sidoni <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Suwe, maye yumwi yeakali Mkanaani yeakwikala pepi na mwani igyo akamueleliye Yesu, amkalongile, “Mtwa, Mwana va Dawudi, ndiwonele lusungu! Muhinja vangu itamika lihoka.” <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Ila Yesu seamuhigile kinu. Vachulila vake vakamuhelelie Yesu, vakamlongie, “Mulongele ahelele kwakuva akutufwata kuno itova kyowo.” <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yesu akavahigile, “Ndikalagichwe kuvalowola vanu va inyi lya Isilaeli vevagehe ngita ng'ondolo vevayagile.” <verse eid="MAT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Maye yula achile na akafugamila pautalo lya Yesu, akalonga, “Mtwa, nditange.” <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yesu akamhigile, “Seunofu kunyamula kyakula kya vana na kuvakumbila mibuwa.” <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Yula maye akahigile, “Ndakyene Mtwa, Ila ata mibuwa gilia masagalilo gyegigua mumesa lya mtwa vao.” <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Baho, Yesu akamhigile, “Maye kudikila kwako nde kukomi, suwe, ugitilwe ngita kye ukela.” Yula muhinja vake akananile bahobaho.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvananicha vanu volofu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maliko 8.1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yesu akahegile baha akahele muling'umbong'umbo lya lihiva Galilaya, akang'ile pakidunda, ikaliye panyi. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Vanu volofu vakamuhelelie na kuvasindika vatenda na vanu ve vagaya meho na vanu taalonga na vangi volofu vevali vatamwa, vakavavikile pautalo lya magulu gake, nave Yesu akavananiche. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Lipinga lila lya vanu lika dudwive hilo pevalolile kuva vanu sevakali viywanga vakiywanga, vevakali vatenda vagenda na vevagaya meho vilola, vanu vakamufunya Nguluvi va Isilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvagavila kyakula vanu elufu chitai</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maliko 8.1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Suwe, Yesu akavakemelie vachulila vake, akalonga, “Ndikuvawonela lusungu vanu ava kwa kuva vagehe na nene figono fidatu vihela kya kulia. Sendikela kuvaleka vahelele ngajila kulya, viwesa vachime mung'asi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Vachulila vakamuhucha, “Baha tugehe kudasi twipata kwiya kyakula kya kuvagavila vanu ava volofu?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu akavahucha, “Mugehe na gibumunda gilinga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Vakamhigile, “Saba na fisomba fikefu hela.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Suwe, Yesu akavalongie lipinga lya vanu vakale panyi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Akaginyamula gila mibumunda saba na fisomba fikefu, akamuhongecha Nguluvi na akafidumula akavagavila vachulila vake, navo vakavagavila vanu mulipinga. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Vonda vakaliye, vakagwita. Kangi vachulila vake vakalundise masigalilo vakamemiche findilu saba. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Avo vevakalie vakali elufu chitai ngajila kuvalila vadala na vana. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Suwe, Yesu akavalaga vanu akakang'ie wato, akahelala pono lya Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Kimanyilo na umanyitu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maliko 8.11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka 12.54-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Suwe, Vafalisayo na Vasadukayo vakamuheleliye Yesu na kumgecha, vakamsukile avagitile kimanyilo kuhuma kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Ila Yesu akavahigile, “Peifika palumiye nyenye mwilonga, ‘Kilau kwihela ndonya kwakuva lifunde nde livalafu!’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Na pamilau mwilomga, ‘Neng'uli kuvecha na ndonya, kwakuva kulifunde kutitu kangi lifunde limemile!’ Suwe, nyenye mwichela chipindi kwa kulolela kumafunde ila semuchela kumanya fimanyilo gya makani gye gihuma chipindi ichi. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Kilelo kya vanu vawofu na sekidikilwa na Nguluvi kikela kimanyilo, ila sekigavilwa kimanyilo kyekyonda ila kimanyilo kilakila kya Yona.” Suwe, akavaleka akahegile.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amila lya Vafalisayo na Vasadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Maliko 8.14-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Vachulila vake pevahagamie lubali lungi lwa lihiva, vakawuwike kuva vasemwile kunyamula mibumunda. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yesu akavalongela, “Mwitase na mwilolele na amila lya Vafalsayo na Vasadukayo!” <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Ila vachulila vake vakali vilingana, “Ilonga endana kwakuva setunyamuwe mibumunda.” <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yesu akachela kyevakali vilongana, akavalongie, “Nyenye vanu semwihela udikilo! Wuli, mwilongana kuva mwihela mibumunda? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Wuli, semwichela? Wuli, semwikuhuka gila mibumunda gihanu gyevalie vanu elufu chihanu? Wuli, mukamemiche findilu filinga fya masigalilo? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Awu gila mibumunda saba gyevagavilwe vala vanu elufu chitai, wuli, mukalundise findilu filinga fya masigalilo. <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Wuli, semukali muchela kuva sendikali ndilonga kutigila mibumunda? Mwilolele na amila lya Vafalisayo na Vasadukayo!” <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Baho, vachulila vakachela kuva akavalongile selisimika lya mibumunda ila mawulanichi gya Vafalisayo na vasadukayo.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peteli alonga pawelu kuva Yesu nde mwana va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maliko 8.27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9.18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu peakali pono lya Kaisalea Filipi, akavauchile vachulila vake, “Vanu vilonga kuva Mwana va Munu nde ani?” <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Vakamuhigile, “Vangi vilonga kuva nde Yohani mbatisa, vangi Elia, vangi Yelemia awu yumwi va vavichi.” <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yesu akavahucha, “Nyenye wuli, mwilonga nene nde ani?” <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simoni Peteli akahigile, “Veve nde Kilisito, Mwana va Nguluvi yegehe wumi.” <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu akalonga, “Ngiba veve Simoni mwana va Yona, kwakuva kwihela munu yeyonda yeakugubukuwe njowo ilyi, ila Daada vangu va kuluhano yeakugubutuliye makani ago. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Nene ndikulongela veve nde Peteli na pakyanya lya liganga ili ndikulichenga lipinga lya vanunve vamuidikiye Kilisito, ata ludali lwa kufuwa sechivesa kuchigina. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Ndikugavila fungulo cha Ung'achale va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, kila kyeudinda muinyi, ndeni ndeni kidindwa kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, kyokyonda kyeudindula muinyi ndeni kidundiliwa kuluwano kwa Nguluvi.” <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Kangi akavakanile vachulila vake vabihile kumlongela munu yeyonda kuva mwene nde Kilisito.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilonga pakyanya lya magudo na kufua kwa mwene</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:31-38">Maliko 8.31-38</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9.22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Kuhuma chipindi ikyo Yesu akavangile kuvalongela vachulila vake kuva nding'ang'wa ahelele ku Yelusalemu, ukoya dandipata magudo gyolofu gyegigitwa na vagogolo, vatekechi vakomi na vawulanichi va malagicho. Ata kudochwa na kigono kya udatu dandichulubuka. <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Baho Peteli akamunyamula na kumsindika pono pihela vanu, akavangile kumulakalila, “Ibihile kuvecha ndeni Mtwa! Lukani ulu lubihile kuhumila kwa veve!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Yesu akaseduka, akamlongela Peteli, “Hege pautalo lyangu Setani! Veve nde kikanilo kwa nene, kwakuva mahocho gyako se ga Nguluvi ila nde ga munu!”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Kangi, Yesu akavalongiye vachulila vake, “Munu yeyonda yeikela kundifwata, ing'ang'wa ikane yumwene, anyamule kipindilihicho lyake ache kwa nene. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Kwakuva munu yeikela kulowola wumi vake, dakuuyacha, <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Ila munu yeiyagicha wumi vake kwakuva lya nene akugapata. Wuli, munu daipata liki ngita daipata umosi vonda va inyi na kuno iyagicha maisa gyake? Awu, munu ihecha kinu liki kivecha badili lya uwumi vake? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Kwakuva Mwana va Munu daikwacha paukomi va Daada vake pamwi na vandumindumi vake kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, baho akuvahomba kila munu kuwana na magito gyake. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongola, kovali vangi baha sevifuwa kabula lya kumulola Mwana va Munu yeikwacha mung'achale vake.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu iseduka wuso</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maliko 9.2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9.28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Pefichumbile figono sita, Yesu akavanyamula Peteli na Yakobo na Yohani lukolo vake Yakobo na kuvasindika pakyanya lya kidunda kitali ukoya vakali weka hela. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Ukoya, Yesu akaseduka wuso pautalo lyao, wuso vake ukang'alile ngita lichua na myenda gyake ikali ivalafu ngita welu. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Baho, vachulila vadatu vakavawene Musa na Elia vakilonga na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Baho, Peteli akamlongiye Yesu, “Mtwa, ndingiba nefwe kusigala baha! Ngita wikela ndichenge fibudi fidatu, kimwi kya veve na kimwi kya Musa na kingi kya Elia.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Peakali ilonga, lifunde leling'ala likagubika na kyowo ikapulikika kuhuma mulifunde, peilonga, “Uyu nde Mwana vangu yendimkeliye, mumpulikiche mwene.” <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Vachulila pevapulike ago vakaguwe lufuma, vakaogwipe hilo. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Yesu akavahelelie, akavapyasa, akavalongela, “Mwime, mbihile kuogofya!” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Pevalolile pakyanya sevamuwene munu yungi ila Yesu hela.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Pevakali vikwika pakidunda, Yesu akavalongile, “Mbihile kumlongela munu lukani ulu chemuchiwene mbaka mwana va munu peichulubichwa.” <verse eid="MAT 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Bao, vachulila vakamuhucha, “Wuli, vawulanichi va malagilicho vilonga kuva ing'ang'wa Elia ache tandi kabula lya Kilisito?” <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu akavahigile, “Ndakyene, Elia ikwacha kuvika unofu makani gyonda. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Ila ndikuvalongela, Elia achile suwe vanu sevakamcheliye, ila vakamgitiye makani manjanganifu ngita pevakakeliye.” Mwana va Munu igudwa ndenindeni pamawoko gyao. <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Baho, vachulila vakachelile kuva akali akuvalongela pakyanya lya Yohani mbatisa.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumnanicha mdimi yeagehe na lihoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maliko 9.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9.37-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Pevafikile kangi palila lipinga, munu yumwi akamuheleliye Yesu, akamfugamila, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />akalongile, “Mtwa mwonele lusungu mwana vangu kwakuva agehe na kilibisi, kangi iguda hilo, mala cholofu mwene igwila mulyoto na mumalenga. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Ndikamsindike kwa vachulila vako ila sevavesile kumnanicha.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Nyenye kilelo mwihela ludikilo, kyekigitile nongwa! Ndikala na nyenye mbaka paliki? Ndikuvahuvilila mbaka pandili? Mumlete baha uyo mwana” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yesu akalikabusa ilyo lihoka likamuhega na yula mwana akananile bahobaho.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Baho vachulila vakamuheleliye Yesu pono pahela vanu, vakamuhuchile, “Kwa liki nefwe setukawesile kumuhecha lila lihoka?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yesu akavahigile, kwakuva semukumudikila Nguluvi. Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, ngiba mumuidikile Nguluvi ludodo ngita mbeyu lya linunu likemelwa haladali, muvecha kukilongela kidunda iki, hege baha helele kula, nakyo kihega. Kwihela kyokyonda sekiwesekana kwa nyeye. <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Lihoka lya endena selihechwa ngita endena ila kwa kusuka na kwikanila kilya.<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu iywanga kangi makani gya kufuwa kwa mwene</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maliko 9.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9.43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Pevakali pamwi ukoya Galilaya, Yesu akavalongile, “Mwana va Munu ilekwa abatwe na vanu. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Navo vakumdocha, ila kigono kya udatu ichulubuchwa.” Vachulila vake vakasogwime hilo.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhomba kodi lya kaye lya Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Suwe, pevafikile Kapelanaumu vanu vevilundasa kodi lya kaye lya Nguluvi vakamuheleliye Peteli, vakamuchile, “Wuli, muwulanichi venu seihomba kodi mukaye lya Nguluvi?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Peteli akahigile, “Ena, itaula.” Baho Peteli peingiye mugati lya kaye lyake, peakali sealongile kinu, Yesu akamuhuchile, “Simoni veve wilola wuli? Vang'achale va muinyi iyi vidumula kodi kuhuma kwa venekaye awu kuhuma kwa vagenji?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Peteli akahigile, “Kuhuma pavagenji.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Yesu akamlongela, “Suwe, ngita yigehe ndeni vana vawo valekilwe kutaula kodi. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Ila neke tubihile kuvavipicha vanu ava, helele ku lihiva kalowe somba, nyamule somba va kwanja yeigomela, dindule mulomo vake na mugati lya mulomo vake ukuilola sendi. Inyamule ukahombe kodi lya nene na veve.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Nde ani Mkomi?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maliko 9.33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9.46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Chipindi chila vachulila vakamuheleliye Yesu, vakamuhucha, “Nde ani mkomi kuchumba vangi muung'achale va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi?” <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yesu akamkemela mwana yumwi akamwimicha pagati lyao, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />akalonga, “Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, ngita semseduka na kuvecha ngita vana, dasemwikwingila ng'odo muung'achale va kuluhano. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Yeyonda yeakwikwisa ngita mwana uyu, mwene nde mkomi muung'achale va kuluhano. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Yeyonda yeakumwanuka mwana ngita uyu kwakuva lya nene, akuniwanuka nene.”<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyovelecha vangi vagite sambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maliko 9.42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17.1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“Yeyonda yeakumuyovelecha yumwi mugati lya vadodo ava vevakunidikila nene abihile kunidikila nene, munu uyo ing'ang'wa awopwe lwala pasingo na kudibachwa mumalenga matali. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Damwilava vanu va inyi iyi kwakuva kugehe na makani gyegakumuyovelecha munu yungi agite sambi! Njowo ichi ching'ang'wa chihumile, ila alava munu yula yeiyovelecha!”<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />“Ngita liwoko awu ligulu lyako likugite ugite nongwa, udumule na kutaga kutali na veve. Ngiba kwaveve kwingila muuwumi ngajila liwoko awu ligulu, kuchumba kutagwa palyoto lya mbepali ukiva na miwoko givili na magulu gako gavili. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Liho lyako likugite ugite nongwa, likule na kulitaga patali na veve. Ngiba kwa veve kwingila uwumi ukiva na liho limwi kuchumba kuvecha na meho gyonda gavili, na kutagwa palyoto weseuchima figono fyonda.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufano va kondolo yeayagile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka 15.3-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Mwilolele! Mubihile kumubeda yumwi va vododo ava. Kwakuva ndikuvalongela ndumindumi vawo ukoya kuluhano figono fyonda vagehe pautalo lya Daada vangu yeagehe kuluhano. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Kwakuva Mwana va Munu achile kuvalowola vala vevayagile.<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Mwilola wuli? Munu yeagehe na kondolo mia na yumwi ayagile, igita liki, wuli seakuvaleka vala tisini na tisa pakidunda na kuhelela kumusaka yula eayagile? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Ndikuvalongela undakyene, peakumwona dakumukedukila uyo yumwi kuchumba peakuvakedukila vala tisini na tisa sevayagile. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Ndeni ndeni, Daada venu va kuluhano seikela ata yumwi va vadodo ava vayage.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumlakalila lukololo vako yeakugitila nogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Lukolo vako peakugitila nongwa, muheleliye ukamulongele kila kyeakugitile, mugite ndeni pemugehe vavili ng'ani. Ngita akupulika uvecha umupatile lukolo vako. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Ngita alema kukupulika, mnyamule munu yumwi awu vavili pamwi na veve, neke mahocho gavaswida vavili awu vadatu njowo chonda chichengwekaya. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Ngita seakuvapulika avo, lilongele lipinga lya vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito. Ngita seakulipulika lipinga lya vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito, mlole ngita vanu sevakumdikila Nguluvi na vadumula kodi.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudinda na kudindula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, kyemwidinda muinyi kidindwa kuluhano kwa Nguluvi kyekidindulilwa muinyi dakidinduliwa kuluhano kwa Nguluvi.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Kangi ndikuvalongela, vavili va muinyi pevakwidikila mulukani lyolyonde na kusuka, Daada vangu va kuluhano daigita lukani ulo. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Kwakuva pevilundise vavili awu vadatu kwakuva lya nene na nene ndivecha pamwi na vene.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufanu va mnyigendwa seihongecha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Suwe, Peteli akamuheleliye Yesu, akamuhuchile, “Wuli, lukolo vangu ngakunigitila nongwa, ndimuhongeche mala chilinga? Mala saba?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Sendilonga mala saba ng'ani, ila umuhongeche mweyago saba mala sabini.” <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Kwakuva Ung'achale va kuluhano uwana na mng'achale yumwi yealamule kulolela unofu luvalilo lya vanyigendwa vake. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Peavangile kuvalila, vakamsindikile munu yumwi yeali na lideni lya fisako elufu kyumi cha sahabu. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Munu uyo akali ihela kinu kyekyonda kya kuhomba, ndeni mng'achale vake akalongile aguchwe mwene na mdala vake na vana vake na finu fyonda fyeagehe nafyo, neke ahombe lila lideni. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Suwe, yula mnyigendwa akafugamile pautalo lyake, akalonga, unihuvilile ludodo nene dandikuhomba lideni lyonda! <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Yula mng'achale akamuwonile lusungu, akamuhongecha lila lideni, akamleka ahelele. <verse eid="MAT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Ila yula mnyigendwa akahelela, akatang'anile na mnyigendwa muyage yeakali na lideni sendi mia yimwi fya madini ga fesa. Akambatile na akamgudile kuno ilonga, hombe lideni lyako! <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Uyo mnyigendwa muyage akafugamile na akalongile ubihile kundiguda nene ndikuhomba! <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Ila mwene seakelie kumleka, akamdindile mukiwopo mbaka peihomba lila lideni. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Baho, vanyigendwa veyage pevalolile lukani lula vakasugwime hilo, vakahelela kumlongela mng'achale vawo makani gala gyevakagawene. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Baho, yula mng'achale kamkemela yula mnyigendwa, veve nde mnyigendwa semnofu! Ukanisukile, ndikuhongesha lideni lyako lyonda na nene ndikakuhongecha lideni lyako lyonda. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Wuli, veve seung'ang'wa kumwonela lusungu mnyigendwa muyago ngita pendikakuwonele lusungu? <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />“Baho, yula mng'achale akavipile hilo, akamsindike mukiwopo yula mnyigendwa agundwe mbaka pala peihomba lideni lyonda.”<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Yesu akamalile kulonga, “Daada yeakali kuluhano akuvagitila ndeni ngita kila yumwi seakumuhongecha lukolo vake kwa numbula lyake lyonda.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Kutolana na kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maliko 10.1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Yesu peamalile kulonga lukani ulo, akahegile ku Galilaya, akahelela ku Yudea yeigehe kumwambo lya mgoka Yolidani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Vanu volofu vakamheleliye ukoya na ukoya Yesu akavananicha vatamwa volofu.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Vamonga va Vafalisayo akamuhelelilye, vakamuhuchile neke vamugomeche, “Wuli, nde ngiba mgosi kumleka mdala vake kwa nongwa yeyonda?” <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yesu akavahigile, “Wuli, semukaimbile mumasimbo gya Nguluvi, kuva Nguluvi kuhuma pamwandi akamuwumbile munu mgosi na mdala? <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Nguluvi akalongile, ‘Kwandeni mgosi akumleka daada vake na maye vake, davaungana na mdala vake, na vene davavecha muvili umwi.’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Nondee, vene sevavili kangi ila nde muvili umwi. Suwe, kyeawunganise Nguluvi, munu abihile kuneng'anicha.” <verse eid="MAT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Ila vawo vakamuchile, “Kwa liki, Musa akatulagiliche kuva mdala agavilwe baluwa lya kulekwa?” <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yesu akavahigile, “Musa akavalongiye muvaleke vadala venu kwakuva lya ukangafu va numbula chenu. Ila kuhuma pamwandi seikali ndeni. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Suwe, ndikuvalongela, munu yeyonda yeakumleka mdala vake ngita sekwanogwa lya ugoni na akatola mdala yungi na mwene igita ugoni. Na yeakumtola mdala uyo na mwene igita ugoni.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Vachulila vake vakamlongile, “Ngita makani gya mgosi na mdala gagehe ndeni, ngiba kuleka kutola.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu akavalongile, “Sevonda viwesa kuwanuka lukani ulu, ila vala hela vevatangilwe na Nguluvi kugita ndeni. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Kwakuva kugehe na njowo cholofu cha kuvagita vagosi vabihile kutola, vangi ndi kwakuva vafuwe kumagulu na vangi vafuwe kumagulu kwakugitilwa na vanu na vangi valamuwe kubihila kutola kwakuva lya ung'achale va kuluhano. Yeivesa kuliwanuka wulanichi wulu na aliwanuke.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvafunya vana vadodo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maliko 10.13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18.15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Suwe, vamonga va vanu vakamsindikile Yesu vana vadodo neke avavikile mawoko na kuvasukila. Ila vachulila vake vakavakanila. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Yesu akalonga, “Muvaleke avo vana vache kwa nene, mubihile kuvakanicha, kwakuva ung'achale va kuluhano ndi va vanu vevagehe ngita vana ava.” <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Suwe, akavavikila mawoko na pambele akahegile pono pala.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mdimi mmosi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maliko 10.17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18.18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Munu yumwi akamhelelile Yesu, akamuhuchile, “Muwulanichi, ndigite kinu liki kinofu neke ndiwanuke uwumi va mbepali?” <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yesu akamhigile, “Wuli, ukunihucha njowo nofu? Agehe yumwi hela yeagehe msanzi. Ngita wing'ang'wa kwingila muwumi, kolela amuli.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Yula munu akamuhuchile, “Amuli liki?” Yesu akamhigile, “Ubihile kudocha na ubihile kugona na ubihile kuhicha na ubihile kuhecha usawida va udesi, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />vaginye daada vako na maye vako na mkele mweyago ngita peukwikela veve.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Yula mdimi akamlongela, “Aga gonda ndiagagitile, nonde ndigite liki kangi?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu akamhigile, “Ngita seukela kupwemukwa na kyokyonda, helele kaguche finu fyako fyonda fyeunafyo na icho sendi ukavagavile vahangala na veve dauvecha na lusanja kuluhano, baho vache unifwate.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Yula mdimi peagapulike ago, akahelela kuno agehe na luswigimo, kwakuva akali na finu fyolofu.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Baho, Yesu akavalongile vachulila vake, “Ndakyene ndikuvalongela daivecha ukangafu hilo kwa mmosi kwingila muung'achale va kuluhano. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Kangi ndikuvalongela, nde upefu kwa mng'oko yeikemelwa ngamia kuchumba palibwenge lya sasia, kuliko kwa mmosi kwingila muung'achale va Nguluvi.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Vala vachulila pevapulike ago vakadudwive hilo vakamuhuchile, “Nde ani nonde dailowoka?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesu akavalolile, akalonga, “Kwa munu njowo ichi sechiwesekana, ila kwa Nguluvi njowo chonda chiwesekana.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Baho Peteli akalonga, “Nwefwe tugalekile gyonda tukufwatile, datuwanuka liki?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu akavalongile, “Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, Mwana va munu peikwacha kukala pakigoda kikomi kya ung'achalea, muinyi imiya, nyenye yemunifwatile damwikala pafigoda kumi na fivili na kuvahiga makabila kyumi na gavili gya Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Na kila munu yeailekile kaye awu lukolo awu muhachave awu daada awu maye awu vana awu migunda kwakuva lya nene, daiwanuka mala mia hilo na kugavilwa uwumi va mbepali. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Ila yevagehe va kwanja davavecha va mwiso na yeagehe va mwiso davavecha va kwanja.”<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Vanyigendwa mumgunda va misabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Ung'achale va kuluhano uwana na munu mwene mgunda va misabibu, yeilavile kuvasindika vanyigendwa mumgunda vake. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Akapatine navo kuvahomba sendi yimwi lya madini lya feza kwa kigono, baho akavasindike mumgunda vake va misabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Akahegile pamilau lya saa udatu, akavawene vanu vangi vihimile pasoko, vihela kasi. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Akawalongile, ‘Mwelele na nyenye mukagite kasi kumgunda vangu va misabibu na nene dandikuvahomba kila kyemwing'ang'wa kuhombwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Suwe, vakahelela, uyo munya mgunda akahega muda va saa sita na saa tisa, akagitile ndeni ndeni. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Chipindi cha saa kyumi na imwi palumiye, akahega kangi, akavawene vanu vangi vihimle pala pasoko. Suwe, akavahucha, ‘Wuli muhimile baha kigono kyonda ngajila kugita kasi?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Vakamuhigile, ‘Kwakuva kwihela munu yeatugavile kasi.’ Mwene akavahigile muhelele na nyenye mukagite kasi mumgunda vangu va misabibu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />Pekukiye, yula munya mgunda akamlongiye muhimilicha vake, vakemele vanyigendwa ukavahombe sendi chawo, uvahombe tandi vala va mwiso na kumalila na vala va kwanja. <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Ndeni, vala vanyigendwa pevakachile chipindi kya palumiye, vakahombilwe kila yumwi sendi yimwi lya madini lya fesa. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Vala vakwanja pevafikile, vakali viwocha vipata kuchumba ila yeahombilwe mweyage, ila ata vawo vakahombilwe ndeni ndeni kila yumwi sendi yimwi lya madini lya fesa. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Vakachiwanuka sendi chawo vakavanga kumusugwima yula munu munya mgunda. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Vakalonga, vanu ava vakagavilwe kasi mumwiso vakagitile kasi kwa muda va lisaa limwi hela, wuli utuhombile ngita avo chipindi nefwe tugitile kasi ngomi na lichuwa likali? <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />“Baho yula munya mgunda akamuhigile yumwi vawo, ‘Mganja sendikanile kukuhomba! Wuli, setukapatine dandikuhomba sendi yimwi lya madini lya fesa kwa kigono? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Nyamule mahombo gako na uhelele. Ndikela kumgavila uyu va mwiso ngita pendikugavile veve. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Wuli, nene sending'ang'wa kugita kyekyonda kyendisaka kwa sendi changu? Awu ukuniwonela wifu kwakuva nene ndi mnofu?’”<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Yesu akamalile kwa kulonga, “Ndeni ndeni, yeivecha va mwiso daivecha va kwanja na va kwanja daivecha va mwiso.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilonga mala lya udatu kufua na kuchulubuka kwa mwene</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maliko 10.32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18.31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Yesu peakli ikang'ala kuhelela ku Yelusalemu pamwi na vachulila vake volofu. Pevakali mung'asi akavanyamula palubali vala vachulila kyumi na vavili na kuvalongela, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Mupulike! Twihelela ku Yelusalemu na ukoya Mwana va Munu daisindikwa kwa vatekechi vakomi na vawulanichi va malagilicho, navo davakumuhiga adochwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Davakumsindika kwa vanu se Vayawudi neke abedeliwe na atovwe ndomondo na kumvamba pakipindilihicho, ila kigono kya udatu daichulubuchwa.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lusuko lwa maye va Yakobo na Yohani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maliko 10.35-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Baho, mdala va Zebedayo akamuheleliye Yesu pamwi na vana vake, akafugamile pautalo lyake na kumsuka amgitile kinu.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesu akamuhuchile, “Wisaka liki?” Yula maye akamlongiye, “Jagile kuva muung'achale vako, ava vana vangu vavili davakala yumwi lubali lwako lwa ndewo na yungi lubali lwako va kusoto.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yesu akahigile, “Semwichela mwisuka liki. Wuli, mwiwesa kunyuwa kikombe kyendinywelela nene?” Vakahigile, “Tuwesa.” <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu akavalongiye, “Ndakyene, damwinyua kikombe kyangu kya magudo, ila kwikala lubali lwangu va ndewo awu kusoto sekasi lya nene, njowo ichi davagavilwa vala vevivikilwe suwe na Daada vangu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Vala vachulila vangi kumi pevapulike ago, vakavavipiye avo vakolo vavili. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Ndeni Yesu akavakemeliye na kuvalongela, “Mwichela kuva vatavala va inyi iyi, vakuvatavala vanu vawo kwa ludali na vevagehe na umwimike vakuvagita ngita vasutu. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Ila kwa nyenye ibihile kuvecha ndeni na munu yeikela kuvecha mkomi pagati lyenu ing'ang'wa kuvecha ndumindumi va vonda, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />na yeikela kuvecha va kwanja pagati lyenu ing'ang'wa aveche msutu venu. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Ngita ndeni, Mwana va Adamu seachile neke agumbanikilwe ila achile kuvagundamikila na kuhecha uwumi vake kuva fupo lya vanu volofu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvananicha vanu vavili vagaya meho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maliko 10.46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18.35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Yesu peakali ihega mumwani va Yeliko, na vanu volofu hilo, vakamfwatile. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Suwe, kukali na vagaya meho vavili vakalile palubali lya mung'asi na pevapulike kuva Yesu ichumbila bahala, vakabwatile, “Mtwa, Mwana va Dawudi, utuwonele lusungu!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Lila lipinga lya vanu likavakabusa na kuvalongela vachike. Ila vawo vakaginicha kubwatuka, “Mtwa, Mwana va Dawudi, utuwonele lusungu!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yesu akahimile, akavakemela na kuvahucha, “Mwikela ndivagitile liki?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Vakamuhigile, “Mtwa, tusaka tulole.”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Suwe, Yesu akavawonela lusungu, akavakolela meho gyawo, bahobaho vakavesile kulola. Vakamfwatile Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ikwingila Yelusalemu kwa lukeduko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohani 12.12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Yesu na vachulila vake pevagehe pepi na Yelusalemu, vakafikile Betifage mufidunda fya miseyituni. Baho, Yesu akavalagiliche vachulila vake vavili, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />akavalongiye, “Muhelele ku kijiji kyekigehe pautalo lyenu na ukoya mukumlola punda agehe na mwana vake vavopwilwe. Muvavopole muvalete kwa nene. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Ngita munu akivahucha kyokyonda wuli mukuvavopola, mumlongele, ‘Mtwa akuvasaka’ na munu uyo daakuvalekela kisatu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Lukani ulu likagitilwe neke gala gyegalongilwe na mvichi gaveche,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Muvalongele vanu va mwani va Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Lole, Ng'achale vako ikwacha!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Ndi mfukomasi na akang'ie punda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">gwada va punda na mwana va punda.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Ndeni, vala vachulila vakahegile vakagita ngita Yesu peavalagilicha. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Vakasindikiye yula punda na mwana vake, wakatandasa myenda pakyanya lya mwanapunda na Yesu ikalile pakyanya lyake. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Lipinga likomi lya vanu vakatandasa myenda gyao mung'asi, vanu vangi vakadumula fikwati vatandase mung'asi. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Lipinga lya vanu vevamlongue na vala vevamfwatile vakabwatile vakilonga, “Unjumwe mwana va Dawudi! Afunyilwe yeikwacha kwa litawa lya Mtwa, anjumwe Nguluvi va kuluhano!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Yesu peakali ikwingila ku Yelusalemu, vanu vonda va mwani wula vakali na nyengema. Vanu vakali vakwihucha, “Uyu ani?” <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Vanu mulipinga lila vakahigile, “Uyu nde Yesu, mvichi va Nguluvi kuhuma Kunasaleti mwani va Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ihelela pakaye lya Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maliko 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohani 2.13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Suwe, Yesu akaingila pono lya Kaye lya Nguluvi, akavadagile kwivala vanu vevakali vigucha na kugula finu mugati lya kaye lya Nguluvi, akachigalambusa findangavala fyavevakali vibadilisa sendi na figoda fya vala vevali vigucha ng'unda. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Akavalongela, “Isimbilwe mumasimbo gya Nguluvi, ‘Kaye lyangu ikemelwa kaye lya kufunyila.’ Ila nyenye muigitile kuva kaye lya vahichi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Vanu vagaya meho na vatenda vakamuheleliye ukoya ku Kaye lya Nguluvi na Yesu akavananiche. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Baho, vatekechi vakomi na vawulanichi va malagilicho pevagawene umanyitu geagitile Yesu, kangi vana pevakali vibwetuka mupono lya Kaye lya Nguluvi, vakilonga, “Anjumwe Mwana va Dawudi,” vakavipile hilo. <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Ndeni, vakamlongiye, “Wuli, seupulika kyevalonga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Yesu akavahigile, “Ndakyene, ndipulika! Wuli, semukwimbile mumasimbo gya Nguluvi aga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:16">Kwa milomo gya vana vadodo na fyali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:16">Nguluvi avagitile vamnjume mwene.”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Suwe, Yesu akavalekile, akahega kwivala lya mwani na kuhelela Betania, ukoya akavasile.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulikotola libiki lyelikemelwa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maliko 11.12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Kinyolasagala Yesu peakali iwuya kuhuma kumwani, akawonile njala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Akaliwene libiki limwi lya mtini palubali lya ng'asi, ila akaliwene lihela kinu ila mikwati ng'ani. Suwe, akaulongela, “Ubihile kubaba kangi manunu mbepali!” Bahobaho lila libiki lya mtini likagamile.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Vachulila pevawene vakadudwive vakalonga, “Kwa liki libiki ilyi lya mtini ugamile kisatu?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesu akavahigile, “Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, ngita muvecha na ludikilo ngajila kuvecha na nyengema, mwivesa kugita sehela ago, ila ata kukilongela kidunda iki, ‘Kikulike ugadibale muinyanza,’ dakihumila. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Pemuvecha na ludikilo, kyokyonda damusuka damuwanuka.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhucho kutigila umwimike va Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maliko 11.27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20.1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yesu akaingile mukaye lya Nguluvi, akali iwulanicha vatekechi vakomi na vavaha va vanu Yesu akahuchilwe, “Ugita njowo ichi kwa kulongelwa na ani? Ani akugavile umwimike ugo?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesu akavahigile, “Na nene ndikuvawucha kinu kimwi, pemuhiga na nene dandikuvahiga kuva ndigita njowo ichi kwa umwimike va ani. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Wuli, umwimike va Yohani va kubatisa ukahumile kwa ani? Wuli, ukahumile kuluhano awu kwa vanu?” Ila vakwihucha vavene kwa vavene, “Tukilonga, ‘Ukahumile kuluhano,’ daatuhucha, ‘Wuli semukamudikiye?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Na tukilonga, ‘Ukahumile kwa vanu,’ Tukogofya lipinga lya vanu kwakuva vonda vakwidikila kuva Yohani akali mvichi va Nguluvi.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Suwe, vakamuhigile, “Nefwe setwichela!” Na Yesu akavalongile, “Na nene sendikuvalongela ndigita njowo ichi kwa umwimike va ani.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufano va vana vavili vakigosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Nyenye mwihocha wuli makani aga, munu yumwi akali na vana vavili vakigosi. Akamlongela yula mlongola, ‘Mwana vangu, neng'uli uhelele ukagite kasi kumgunda va misabibu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Yula mwana akamlongela Daada vake, ‘Nene ndilema!’ Ila pambele akagalambula mahocho, akahele kugita kasi. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Yula Daada akamlongela mwana vake yungi ndeni ndeni, mwene kamuhigile, ‘Ena Daada ndibita!’ Ila seakahelele kumgunda. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Wuli, ndi ani mugati lya ava vakigosi vavili yeagitile geang'ang'ile Daada vake?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Vakamuhigile, “Yula mlongola.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Suwe, Yesu akavalongela, “Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, vadumula usulu na vaselati davakuvalongola kwingila Muung'achale va Nguluvi. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Kwakuva Yohani Mbatisa akachile kwa nyenye kuvawonesa ng'asi nofu lya kwikala, nyenye semukamudikile, ila vadumula usulu na vaselati vakamudikile. Ata pemuwonele ago gyonda nyenye semukalekile sambi na kumudikila.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufano va vagima va mgunda va misabibu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maliko 12.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20.9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Yesu akavalongile, “Mpulikiche mufanu wungi. Munu yumwi mwene kaye akagimile mgunda va misabibu, akauchingilicha lukanji, akakovile likombo lya kukamila difwayi, akachengile ukoya lilingo litali. Kangi akalikodisa kwa vagima, akahegile kuhelela inyi lya kutali. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Pekifikile chipindi cha kubena, akavalagiliche vanyigendwa vake kwa vala vagima, neke vakanyamule mabenelo gake. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Vala vagima vakavabatile vala vanyigendwa, yumwi vakamtovile na yungi vakamdochile na yungi vakamtovile na maganga. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Yula munu akavalagiliche kangi vanyigendwa vangi, volofu kuchumba va pamwandi. Vala vagima vakavagitile ndeni ndeni ngita va pamwandi. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Pambele akamulagiliche mwana vake kuno ihocha, ‘Davakumginya mwana vangu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Ila vala vagima pevamuwene mwana vake vakaywangile vavene. ‘Uyu nde muhala na tumdoche neke tunyamule uhala vake!’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Suwe, vakambatile vakamuhecha kwivala lya mgunda lya msabibu, vakamudochile.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />“Nondee, Yesu akahuchile uyo munya mgunda va misabibu daikwacha, davagita liki vala vagima?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Vene vakamuhigile, “Ndakyene davakuvahananga vala vanu vawofu na mgunda dakuvagavila vagima vangi na pambele vala vagima davakumgavila pono lya mabenelo chipindi cha kubena.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Baho, Yesu akavalongile, “Wuli, semwimbile lukani ulu Mumasimbo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Liganga lyevalikanile vachengaji</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">nondee livechile liganga likomi lya kitamiko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Mtwa nde yeagitile lukani ulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">lyene ndi lya umanyitu hilo kwa nefwe.”<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Yesu akaendelela kulonga, “Nondee ndikuvalongela, ung'achale va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi dauhechwa kwa nyenye na kugavilwa vanu sevakumchela Nguluvi na vevagita geing'ang'a Nguluvi.” <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Yeiguwa paliganga ilyo daidenyeka fipande fipande na yula dalikumgwiliya dalimsinginya.<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Vatekechi vakomi na Vafalisayo pevapulike mifanu gyake vakachele akali akuvalongela vene. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Nondee, vakasakile ng'asi lya kumbata, ila vakavawogwipe vanu kwakuva vene vakamuchele kuva ndi mvichi va Nguluvi.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Mufanu va lihungu lya kutola</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka 14.15-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu akaendeliye kuvalongela vakomi va Vayahudi kwa mufanu, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Ung'achale va kuluhano uwanine na mng'achale yeamwandalisiye mwana vake lihungu lya kutola. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Suwe, akavalagiliche vanyigendwa vake, kuvakemela vanu vache mulihungu lya kutola, ila vevakemelwe vakakanile kwacha. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Akavalagilicha kangi vanyigendwa vangi, akavalongela, ‘Muvalongele vala vevakemeliwe, mulihungu lyangu liandaliswe suwe, ndihinjile suwe mikambako vangu na gwada vevanonile, kila kinu kigehe suwe, mwache mulihungu.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Ila vene sevahochile, vakahelela, yumwi kumgunda vake, yungi kukasi chake, <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />na vangi vakavabatile vala vanyigendwa vakavagudise na vakavadocha. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Yula mng'achale akavipile, akavalagilicha vapuga vake vakavadoche avo vanu na kuhananga mwani vawo kwa lyoto. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Kangi akavalongiye vanyigendwa vake, ‘Lihungu lya kutola igehe pepi, ila vala vevakemeliwe vakakaile kwacha. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Ila muhelele mung'asi na vovonda vala mukuvawona muvalongile vache mulihungu lya kutola.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Vala vanyigendwa vakahega, vakahelala mung'asi vakavakung'asa vanu vonda vevawene, vawofu na vanofu. Ludamo lya lihungu lya kutola lukamemile vagenji.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Mng'achale peingile kuvalola vagenji, akamuwene munu yumwi seafwalile miyenda gya lihungu. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Mng'achale akamuhuchile, ‘Mwato, uwingile wuli baha ngajila mwenda va lihungu?’ Ila mwene akachikile hela. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Baho Ng'achale akavalongiye vanyigendwa, ‘Mumuwope magulu na mawoko mumtage kwivala kukisi, ukoya daivemba na kusigina mino.’”<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Yesu akamalile kwa kulonga, “Vevakemeliwe ndi volofu ila vevahaguliwe ndi vadodo.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu iwuchwa kuhomba kodi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maliko 12.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20.20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Baho, Mafalisayo vakahele, vakahuchine vigita wuli neke vakumgomecha wuli Yesu kwa makani gyake. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Suwe, vakavalagiche vachulila vawo pamwi na vachulila va lipinga lya Helode. Vanu avo pevafikile kwa Yesu Vakamuhuchile, “Muwulanichi, twichela kuva veve ndi munu mndakyene na uwulanicha ng'asi lya undakyene lya Nguluvi, seukumlola munu yeyonda, kwakuva ukomi va munu sekinu kwa veve. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Nondee, tulongele, ndi ngiba awu sengiba kuhomba kodi kwa mng'achale mkomi va ku Loma?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Ila Yesu akachele uwofu vawo, akavalongela, “Nyenye vafyangu wuli mukunigecha? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Muniwonese sendi lya kuhombela kodi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Vakamuwonesile sendi. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Suwe, Yesu akavahucha, “Wuso na litawa ilyi lya ani?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Vakamuhigile, “Mng'achale mkomi va ku Loma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Yesu akavalongela, “Fya ng'achale mkomi va ku Loma mumgavile Ng'achale va ku Loma na fya Nguluvi mgavile Nguluvi.” <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Pevagapulike ago vakadudwive, vakamulekile, vene vakahega.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu iwuchwa makani gya kuchulubuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maliko 12.18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20.27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Kigono kikila, vamonga va Vasadukayo vevilonga vanu vevafuwe sevachulubuka, vakamuheleliye Yesu, vakamuhuchile. <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />“Muwulanichi, Musa akalongile munu yeatolile peifua ngajila kuleka vana na mkolo vake ing'ng'wa kumtola yula mgane, neke amubabile vana mkolo vake yeafuwe. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Suwe, ata kwa nefwe pakali na vakolo saba. Vakwanja akatolile mdala na akafuwe ngajila kubaba mwana, akamlekile lukolo vake yula mgane. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Ikali ndeni, kwa lukolo va pili na vadatu mbaka va saba. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Pevafue vakolo vonda avo, akafuwe na yula mgane. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Nondee, kigono kya kuchulubuka, mgane uyo daivecha mdala va ani mugati va vala vakolo saba? Kwakuva vonda saba vakamtolile.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yesu akavahigile, “Nyenye mkosiye kwakuva semuchela masimbo ga Nguluvi vala ludali lwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Kwakuva vanu vafue pevuchulubuka sedavitola vala kutahuka, davivecha ngita ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Ila kwa lila lukani lya kuchulubuka kwa vanu, wuli, semwimbile gala gyeavalongile Nguluvi? Akavalongile, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Nene ndi Nguluvi va Ibulahimu, Nguluvi va Isaka na Nguluvi va Yakobo!’ Suwe, mwene se Nguluvi va vanu vevafuwe, ila ndi Nguluvi va vanu vevagehe wumi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Gala mapinga lya vanu pevapilike ago vakadudwive na mawulanichi gyake.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amuli ngomi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Maliko 12.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10.25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Vafalisayo pevapulike kuva Vasadukayo vahela makani gangi ga kumgomecha Yesu, suwe, vene vakatang'ana pamwi. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Yumwi va Mafalisayo, munu yeichela malagilicho, akamuhuchile Yesu kwa kumugecha, <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Muwulanichi, ndi amuli liki yeigehe ngomi mulagilicho?” <verse eid="MAT 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yesu akamuhigile, “‘Mkele Mtwa Nguluvi vako kwa numbula lyako lyonda na kwa muhe vako vonda na kwa luhala lwako vonda.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Iyi nde amuli ngomi na lya kwanja. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Lya uvili iwana na ilyo, ‘Mkele mweyago ngita pekwikela veve’. <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Malagilicho gyonda ga Musa na mawulanichi gya vavichi va Nguluvi ihuvilila amuli ichi chivili.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njowo cha Kilisito Mukombosi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maliko 12.35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20.41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Vafalisayo peviyilundase pamwi, Yesu akavahucha. <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Nyenye mwihocha liki kwa Kilisito Mkombosi? Ndi mwana va ani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Vene vakamuhigile, “Ndi mwana va Dawudi.” <verse eid="MAT 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yesu akavalongile, “Suwe, ivecha wuli Dawudi peilongichwa na Muhe va Nguluvi akumkemela mwene Mtwa? Kwakuva akalongile, <verse eid="MAT 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‘Mtwa akamlongiye Mtwa vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">kale pepi na nene mulubali lyangu lya ndewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">Mbaka pendikuvasida vachundwama vako.’<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Suwe, ngita Dawudi akumkemela Kilisito, ‘Mtwa,’ iwesa wuli Kilisito kuvecha mwana va Dawudi?” <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Kwihela munu yeyonda yeavesile kumuhiga Yesu. Kuhuma kigono ikyo kwihela munu yeagechile kumuhucha kangi kinu.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalakilila vanu kutigila vawulanichi va malagilicho na Vafalisayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Maliko 12.38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luka 11.43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20.45-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Baho, Yesu akavalongile vala vanu volofu pamwi na vachulila vake vevagehe pala, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Vawulanichi va malagilicho na Vafarisayo nde vevagavilwe umwimike vakuganula malagilicho gya Nguluvi gyeamgavile Musa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Suwe, mugakolele na kugagitila kasi gyonda gyemuwulanichwa. Ila mbihile kugafwata magito gyao, kwakuva vene sevigita na kugafwata gyonda gyeviwulanicha. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Vawo huwopa michigo misito na kuvatwika vanu mumavega na mumituwe gyawo, ila vene seviwesa kugolola ata kyala neke kuginyamula michigo igyo. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Vawo vigita magito gyawo gyonda neke valolwe na vanu. Ila vifwala finiku fyefisimbilwe malagilicho muwuso na mumawoko gyawo. Na vifwala mihingila fyefigehe na fihundo. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Vanu avo vikela kwikala figoda fya kutalo mulihungu na kwikala figoda fya uginyange fya pautalo mukaye lya kutang'anila Vayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Vikela kuhungilwa kwa kuginywa kusoko na vikela kukemelwa na vanu, muwulanichi. <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Ila nyenye mbihile kukemelwa muwulanichi, kwakuva muwulanichi venu nde yumwi hela na nyenye vonda nde vachulila vangu. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Mubihile kumkemela munu yeyonda Daada, baha muinyi, kwakuva Daada venu nde yumwi ng'ani yeagehe kuluhano. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Kangi, mubihile kukemelwa filongochi, Kwakuva kilongochi venu nde yumwi ng'ani nde Kilisito. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Munu yeyonda yeing'ang'a kuvalongocha, ing'ang'wa kwiyikwisa na aveche mchulila venu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Munu yeyonda yeikwikang'acha Nguluvi daakumkwisa na yeyonda yeikwikwisa Nguluvi daakumkang'acha.”<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilakalila kutigila vafyangu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:40">Maliko 12.40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka 11.39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20.47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />“Damwilava nyenye vawulanichi va malagilicho na Vafalisayo vemugehe vafyangu! Kwakuva mukuvakanicha vanu kwingila ku ung'achale va kuluhano kwa mawulanichi gyenu. Kuno nyenye vevene semukwingila mugati vala semukuvalekela vangi vevikela kwingila. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Damwilava nyenye vawulanichi va malagicho na Vafalisayo vemugehe vafyangu! Mukuvagudisa vagane na kwigita kuva nyenye vanu vasanzi kwa kusuka lufunyo lutali. Ndeni damwipata magudo makomi.<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Damwilava nyenye vawulanichi va malagilicho na Vafalisayo vemugehe vafyangu! Nyenye mwigenda hilo mung'asi na kuhagama inyanza neke kumupata munu yumwi yese Muyawudi na kuvecha Muyawudi. Pemukumupata, mukumgita ahelele hilo mulyoto veseuchima ngita mwavene.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Damwilava nyenye filongochi vemgaya meho! Nyenye mwiwulanicha kuva munu peilapa kwa kaye lya kutang'anila Vayahudi kilapo ikyo sekinu, ila peikwilapa kwa sahabu lya mu Kaye lya kutang'anila Vayahudi, kilapo ikyo kikumkolela. <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Nyenye vagaya meho vapufi! Liki kyekigehe ngiba hilo, sahabu awu Kaye lya Nguluvi lyelikuigita sahabu iveche lya Nguluvi? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Kangi mwilonga kuva munu agite kulapa kwa kindangavala kya kunyanyila usembe sekinu, ila agite kulapa kwa fupo yeivikilwe pakyanya lya kindangavala kya kunyanyila usembe, kilapo ikyo kikumkolela. <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Ndakyene nyenye vagaya meho! Nde liki kyekigehe kinofu hilo, yila fupo awu kindangavala kya kunyanyila usembe yeikuigita ilyo fupo iveche lya Nguluvi? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Ndeni, yeilapa kwa kindangavala kya kuhechela usembe, uyo akwilapila pandangavala na kyekyonda kyekivikilwe pakyanya lyake. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Yeilapa kwa kaye lya Nguluvi alapile kwa kaye iyo na kwa Nguluvi yeakwikala mugati lyake. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Yeilapa kwa luhano ilapa kwa kigoda kya Ung'achale va Nguluvi na kwa Nguluvi yeakwikala pakigoda ikyo. <verse eid="MAT 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />Damwilava nyenye Vawulanichi va malagilicho na Vafalisayo vemgehe vafyangu! Kwakuva muhecha pono yimwi lya kyumi, ata nyasafu na kalubwagila na mgagani, ila mwikana makani gya malagilicho ngita kwidikilwa pautalo lya Nguluvi na kuvecha na lusungu na ludikilo na kuvecha mndakyene kwa Nguluvi na kwa vanu vangi. Ila mwing'ang'wa mugagite gyonda makomi na madodo pamwi. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Filongosi vagaya meho! Mwihecha lihachi mukinyuwo ila mwimila mng'oko yeikemlwa Ngamila!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Damwilola nyenye vawulanichi va malagilicho na Vafalisayo vemugehe vafyangu! Mwiwogofecha kikombe na libakuli kwivala, ila mugati muleka kumemile finu fyemunyagile na uwimi. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Nyenye Vafalisayo vagaya meho! Muwogofeche tandi kikombe kyako mugati na kwivala dakivecha kinofu.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Damwivala nyenye vawulanichi va malagilicho na Vafalisayo vafyangu! Mugehe ngita makabuli gyegibakilwe chokaa kwa kwivala gionekana kuva ginofu, ila mugati gimemile michege gya vanu vevafue na kila kinu kihofu. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Kangi nyenye mwioneka na vanu kwivala kuva vasanzi, ila kwa mugati umelile ufyangu na sambi.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matovo gikwacha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka 11.47-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Damwilola nyenye vawulanichi va malagicho na Vafalisayo vafyangu! Mukugachengelela makabuli gya vavichi na kugalembecha mikabuli gya vanu vasanzi. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Mwilonga, ‘Ngita nefwe ngatuvechile chipindi cha vagogolo vetu nga setuvechile pamwi kuvadocha vavichi!’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Ndeni, nyenye mwiwonesa kuva ndi vana va vanu vevavadochile vavichi. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Mumalisile wula uwofu va vagogolo venu vevauvangiche! <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Nyenye kilelo kya lyoka vene sumu! Mwiwesa wuli kwiyepa lihigo lya lyoto mbepali? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Nde, kwakuva nene ndikuvasindikila nyenye vavichi, vanu vene usanzi na vawulanichi, damukuvadocha na kuvaguda vamonga vawo na vangi mukuvatova ndomondo mukaye lya kufunyila na kuvasaka mumwani vonda. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Ndeni makani aga gyonda gavecha pakyanya lyenu, kuhuma kwa Kaini peamdochile Abeli yeakali ihela nongwa na ata vagogololo venu pevakamudochile baha muinyi Zakalia mwana va Balakia ukoya Kaye lya Nguluvi na pagatigati lya pakindangavala kya saba na kindangavala kya kunyanyila usembe. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Ndikuvalongela ndakyene, kilelo iki dakigudiswa kwakuva lya makani aga.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu peavakeliye vanu va mwani va ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luka 13.34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Nyenye vanu va ku Yelusalemu! Nyenye vanu va ku Yelusalmu! Mukuvadocha vavichi na kuvatova maganga vala vevalagilichwe kwa nyenye. Mala chongofu ndigechile kuvalundasa vana venu kwa nene, ngita file ng'uku peilundasa fyana fyake panyi lya mabatilo chake, ila seukakeliye. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Suwe, lolele! Nguluvi daileka Kaye lyenu, kuvecha mahame. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Ndikuvalongela, daseukunilola kangi mbaka dawilonga, ‘Afunyilwe uyo yeikwacha kwa litawa lya Mtwa.’”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ilonga kuhanang'wa kwa Kaye lya Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:1">Maliko 13.1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5">Luka 21.5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:6">6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yesu akahegile ku Kaye lya Nguluvi na peakali ihelela, vachulila vake vakamuheleliye, vakamuwonisile Kaye cha Nguluvi. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Yesu akavalongiye, “Ndakyene, mwiwesa kugalola aga gyonda! Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, kwihela ata liganga limwi dalisigala baha pakyanya lya lingi, kila kinu dakitunyulwa.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utumama na magudo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maliko 13.3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21.7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Yesu peakali akalile pakidunda kya Misaituni, vachulila vake vakamuheleliye neke vavecha weka hela na kumuhucha, “Tulongele njowo ichi dachihumila pandili? Ndi kimanyilo liki dakiwonesa kwacha kwa veve na mwiso va inyi?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu akavahigile, “Mwilolele munu abihile kuvachanga. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Kwakuva volofu davihumila vakilonga kila yumwi kuva, ‘Mwene ndi Kilisito Mkombosi!’ Na davakuvachanga vanu volofu. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Damwipulika makani ga fita na lupwepo lwa fita, ila mubihile kuva na nyengema, kwakuva ago ging'ang'wa gahumile, ila mwiso vene wave kufika. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Vanu va inyi yimwi vakwitova na vanu va inyi yingi, vanu va ung'achale umwi utovana na vanu va ung'achale wungi. Pono pamonga muinyi dakuvecha na njala na liyighayigha kila pono. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Gonda ago ndi ngita lihingili lya kwanja lya kubaba mwana.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Akaendeliye kulonga kangi vakuvahecha neke mgudwe na kudochwa. Inyi chonda chikuvavipila kwakuva lya kunidikila nene. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Kangi, vanu volofu davaleka kumdikila Nguluvi, davayivifya na kangi dasevakelana. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Baho, davahumila vavichi volofu va udesi davakuvachanga vanu volofu. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Kangi lukelo lwa vanu volofu daupwemuka kwakuva lya sambi chihongelike. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Ila munu daikwima ukangafu mbaka mwiso kwa kumdikila Kilisito, dailowolwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Ila peyave kufika mwiso, ichi Njowo Nofu lya ung'achale va Nguluvi dachidalikwa muinyi chonda, ili vanu vonda vaichele.”<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utatala ukomi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maliko 13.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21.20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Suwe, pemwilola lukani lwa kuvipisa lyelileta uhanang'o lihimile mu Kaye lya Nguluvi, ngita pealongile mvichi va Nguluvi Danieli.” Suwe, munu yeikwimba ing'ang'wa achele! <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Suwe, vevagehe ku Yudeya na vanyilile pafidunda. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Munu yeagehe kukyanya lya kituvili kya kaye lyake abihile kwika kunyamula kinu mukaye lyake. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Yeagehe kumgunda abihile kuwuya kukaye lyake kunyamula mwenda vake. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Damwilava nyenye va maye vene lusololo na vevikong'elecha figono ifyo! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Musuke neke kunyila kwenu kubihile kuvecha kigono kya ng'ala awu Kigono kya Kutulula! <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Kwakuva chipindi icho dakuvecha na utatala ukomi weseukahumiye kuhuma peiwumbilwe inyi mbaka neng'uli, vala sedaihumila kangi. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Ila Nguluvi achipwemuse suwe figono ifyo kwakuva lya vanu vake yeavahaguwe, ngita Nguluvi ngaseagitile ndeni ngakuhela ata munu yumwi ngailowolwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />“Suwe, kwa figono ifyo munu iwesa kuvalongela, ‘Kilisito agehe baha!’ Awu ‘Agehe kula!’ Mubihile kumwidikila. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Kwakuva davahumila va Kilisito vaudesi na vavichi va udesi. Davagita kimanyilo kikomi na umanyitu wongofu gakuvachanga ata kwa vala vevahaguliwe na Nguluvi. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Mwilolele! Nene ndivalongele suwe pegave kuhumila makani ago. <verse eid="MAT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />Suwe, pevakuvalongela, ‘Mulole, agehe kuwelu’, mubihile kuhelela ukoya, awu, ‘Mulole, ayifyamile mukaye,’ mubihile kwidikila, <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />kwakuva, ngita lung'ali lwa mdilimo peung'alicha kuhuma palihumila lichuwa mbaka pelidibalila lichuwa, nde peikwacha Mwana va Munu. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Pala peugehe lifimba, vandapu davakwikung'asa baho.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwacha kwa mwana va Munu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maliko 13.24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21.25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“Bahobaho, peusilila utatala mufigono ifyo, Nguluvi daigulambucha lichuwa kuvecha kisi, mwechi navo seung'alicha, na nondwa nacho dachiguwa kuhuma kuluhano na ndeni ndeni Nguluvi daihongesesa ludali cha kuluhano. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Baho, daihumila kimanyilo kya Mwana va Munu kuluhano na vanu vonda va inyi davadadava. Kila munu dakumulola Mwana va Munu peikwacha kuhuma mumafunde lya kuluhano akivecha na ludali na ukomi wolofu. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Na mwene dakuvalagilicha vandumindumi vake kuno vakitova lingalapi, navo daavalundasa vanu veavahagule kuhuma lubali chonda chitai cha inyi, kuhuma mwiso va luhano mbaka mwiso wungi.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwiwulaniche kuhuma mulibiki lya mkuyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maliko 13.28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21.29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Mwiwulaniche kuhuma mulibiki lya mkuyu. Makwati gyake pegivanga kuhomala vilembulo na makwati, mwichela kuva ndonya igehe pepi kwacha. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Ndeni ndeni, pemwilola njowo ichi chonda chigitwa, muchele kuva agehe pepi kwacha. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Ndikuvalongela ndakyene, kilelo iki se kichumba kabula lya makani aga gahumile. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Luhano na inyi chichumba, ila njowo changu dasechichumba.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwihela yeichela kigona vala lisaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:32">Maliko 13.32</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:35">35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luka 17.26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Ila, kwihela ata munu yumwi yeichela kigono awu lisaa daikwacha pandili, vala ndumindumi va kuluhano, vala Mwana, ila Daada weka hela, nde yeichela. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Ngita peikali chipindi cha Nuhu, nde peivecha chipindi cha kwacha kwa Mwana va Munu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Kwakuva chipindi icho, kabula lya malenga myolofu kugubika inyi, vanu vakali vilia na kunyuwa, vakitola na kutawuka, mbaka Nuhu peaingile muwato mkomi veukemelwe lisafina. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Sevachele lyolyonda, mbaka malenga pegagubike inyi na kuvadocha vanu volofu. Nde peivecha chipindi cha kwacha kwa Mwana va Munu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Chipindi icho vanu vavili davavecha kumgunda, yumwi dainyamulwa na yungi dailekwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Vamaye vavili davivecha vilidibula mbwage, yumwi dainyamulwa na yumwi dailekwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Suwe, mwilolele, kwakuva semuchela kigono kya kuwuya kwa Mtwa Nguluvi vetu. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Ila muwuwike lukani ulu, ngita mwene kaye ngaichela kigono kya muhichi kwacha, sengaigona, vala sengailekile kaye lyake idenywe. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Nondee na nyenye muveche suwe, kwakuva Mwana va Munu daikwacha chipindi semukichele.”<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufanu va mnyigendwa mndakyene</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka 12.41-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />Yesu akaendelela kulonga, “Nde ani yeagehe mnyigendwa mndakyene, yeagehe na lukali, Mtwa vake daakumvika kulolela vanyingendwa vake na kuvagavila kyakula chipindi chene? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Afunyilwe mnyigendwa yula mtwa vake daikwacha, daakumlola daigita ngita pealagilichwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, daakumvika mnyigendwa uyo, aveche muhumilicha va finu fyake fyonda. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Ila ngita mnyigendwa semnofu peakwilongela munumbula, ‘Mtwa vangu acheliwe kuwuya,’ <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />kangi akavangile kuvatova vanyigendwa vayage, akavangile kuliya na kunyuwa pamwi na vanywaji, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Mtwa vake daakwacha kigono seakicheliye na lisaa selichelile. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Damtova hilo mnyigendwa uyo na kumvika pono pamwi na vafyangu. Ukoya dakuvecha kivembo na kusigina mino.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Mufanu va vahinja kyumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />“Yesu akahendelele kulonga, chipindi icho, ung'achale va kuluhano dahuwana na vahinja kyumi vevanyamuwe taa chawo, vakahele kumlola mtwa va lihungu. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Vahanu mugati vawo vakali vapufu na vahanu vakali na luhala. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Ila vala vapufi vakanyamula taa chawo, ila sevakanyamule mafuta ga kuhongelecha pambele. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Ila vala vene luhala vakanyamule taa chawo na mafuta gangi mulibochobocho. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Kwakuva yeitola akachelewile kwacha, vala vahinja vonde vakavanga kusinjila, vakavasile.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />“Mulogoti kukali na kyowo, ‘Mlole yula pala yeitola ikwacha muhelele mukamlole!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Baho vala vahina vonda vakalamwike na kuvika unofu taa chawo. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Vala vapufi vakavalongela vala vene luhala, ‘Tusuka mafuta gyenu kidodo kwakuva taa chetu chichimile.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Ila vala vene luhala vakavalongela, ‘Segitosa kwa nefwe na nyenye! Ngiba muhelele muduka mukagule gyenu!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Ila vala vahinja vapufi pevaheliye kugula mafuta, yeitola akafikile, vala vahinja vene luhala vakaingila pamwi na mwene mukaye lya yeitola, baho vakadindile mlyangilo. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Pambeli vala vahinja vangi vakaachile, vakakemela, ‘Mtwa, Mtwa, tudinduliye!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Ila mwene akavahigile, ‘Ndikuvalongela ndakyene sendivachela nyenye.’” <verse eid="MAT 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Kangi Yesu akalonga, “Mwilolele! Kwakuva semuchele kigono vala lisaa.”<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufanu va vanyigendwa vadatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luka 19.11-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Chipindi icho daivecha ngita munu yumwi yeikela kugendela kumwambo, akavakemeliye vachwindama vake na kuvagavila finu fyake fyonda. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Akamgavile kila munu kuwana na umwike vawo, yumwi sendi talanta chihanu, yungi talanta chivili na yungi talanta imwi, baho akahegile. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Baho, yula yeagavilwe sendi talanta chihanu akagitile kasi na akapatile fwaida talanta chihanu. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Ndeni ndeni, na yula yeagavilwe talanda chivili akapatile fwaida talanta chivili. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Ila yula yeagavilwe talanta imwi akahele, akagimile lilindi pamganga akafiile sendi lya mtwa vake.”<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />Pevichumbile figono fyolofu, yula mtwa kawuya, akavangile kulola mavalilo gya kutumila gya mapato gya sendichake. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Mnyigendwa yeagavilwe fisako fya sendi chihano, akaachile kuno aletile fisako fingi fya sendi chihanu, akamlongela, Mtwa, ukanigavile fisako fya sendi chihanu, ndeni ndipatile fisako fingi fya sendi chihano fyefihongeleke. <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Mtwa vake akamlongela, ugitile unofu hilo. Veve ndi mnyigendwa msanzi na mndakyene! Kwakuva ukali msanzi kwa makani madodo gendikakugavile, nondee, dandikuvika muhumilichi va finu fyangu fyonda fyolofu, wache tukeduke pamwi. <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Mnyigendwa yeagavilwe talanta chivili akaachile, akahumicha talanta chivili faida. Nyamule talanta chivili kuchumba nde faida nikapatile. <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Mtwa vake akamlongela, ugitle unofu hilo. Veve mnyigendwa msanzi kangi ndi mndakyene! Kwakuva ukali mndakyene kwa makani madodo, nondee dandikuvika uveche muhumilicha mufinu fyangu fyolofu. Vache ukeduke pamwi! <verse eid="MAT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />“Ila yula yeagavilwe msako wumwi va sendi akachile, akalonga, ‘Mtwa, ndichela veve nde munu mng'ali, veve ubena pono seuvyalile na kulundasa mabenelo seukamiliche. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Ndikaogwipe kuyagicha msako va sendi vako, ndikahelele kusila msako va sendi vako mumganga. Nondee, nyamule msako va sendi vako ugu.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Mtwa vake akamlongela, veve nde mnyigendwa semnofu na mgata! Uchela kuva nene ndibena pono sendivyalile, na kulundasa pono sendimichiche? <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Ikakung'ang'ile kuvinikila msako vangu va sendi mulusanja neke pendiwuya ndipatile msako vangu va sendi na wungi veuhongeleke! <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Nondee, mumnyage ichi sendi ukamgavile yula mwene talanta kumi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Kwakuva, yeali na kinu igavilwa na kulutichwa. Ila yeihela kinu ata kila yeanakyo inyagwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Na mumtage mnyigendwa uyu mnjanganifu ukoya daivemba na kusigina mino.<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhigo lya mwiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Chipindi Mwana va Munu peikwacha muukomi vake na vandumindumi vonda vakiva pamwi na vene, baho daikwikala pakyanya lya kigoda kyake kya ukomi, <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />inyi chonda dachilundasa pautalo lyake na mwene dakuvanenga vanu ngita mkwamila akuvanenga kondolo na mene. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Akuvavika kondolo lubali lwa ndewo na mene lubali lwake lwa nyingi. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Kangi ng'achale akuvalongela vala vevagehe lubali vake va ndewo, mwache nyenye nyemfunyilwe na Daada vangu, muwanuke ung'achale veuvikilwe kuhuma peiumbilwe inyi. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Kwakuva ndikali na njala mukanigavile kya kuliya, ndikali na ng'elu nyenye mkanigavile malenga, ndikali mgenji nyenye mukandiwanuke, <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />ndikali ufula, mukanifyalise mwenda, ndikali mukiwopo na nyeye mukachile kunilola. <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Baho, avo vanu va sanzi davakamuhigile ng'achale, ‘Mtwa, nde paliki tukakuwena ungehe na njala na nefwe tukakugavila kyakula, awu uveche na ng'elu nefwe tuka kugavila malenga? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Nde paliki tukakuwene mgenji na nefwe tukakupokela, awu bila mwenda nefwe tukakugaviye mwenda. <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Nde paliki tukakuwene ukali mtamwa awu ukali mukiwopo tukachile kukulola?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Ng'achale dakuvahiga, ‘Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, kila kinu kyemumgitile yumwi va ava lukolo vangu vadodo vevakunifwata nene, mukanigitile nene!’<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Kangi akavalongile vala vevagehe lubali vake va nyigi, muhege pautalo lyangu nyenye nyemukanilwe na Nguluvi! Muhelele pa lyoto lya mbepali yeawuvikile Setani na vandumindumi vake. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Kwakuva ndikali na njala na nyenye semukandigavile kyakuliya, ndikali na ng'elu nyenye semukandigavile malenga. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Ndikali mgenji nyenye semukandiwanuke, ndikali mtamwa na ndikali mukiwopo nyenye semwachile kunilola.<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />“Baho vene vakumuhiga, ‘Mtwa, pandili nefwe tukakuwene ukali na njala awu ng'elu awu ukali mgenji awu ukali uhela mwenda awu ukali mtamwa awu munu yeagehe mukiwopo na nefwe setukutangile?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Namwene akuvahiga, ‘Ndikuvalongela ndakyene, kila pemwikana kumtanga yumwi va ava vadodo, mukakanile kunitanga nene.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Nondee, ava vihelela mumagudo ga mbepali, ila vala vasanzi vihelea mu uwumi va mbepali.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Mupango va kumdocha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliko 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luka 22.1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohani 11.45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Yesu peamalile kulonga ago gonda, akavalongile vachulila vake. <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Mwichela kuva pefichumba figono fivili kuvecha na lihungu lya pasaka, na Mwana va Munu daihumichwa neke agudichwe pakipindilihicho.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Chipindi icho vatekechi vakomi na vavaha va malagilicho vakatang'ine pamwi palidamwa lya mtekechi mkomi, litawa lyake Kayafa. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Vakagitile mupango va kumbata Yesu kwa lupwepo neke vamdoche. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Ila vakalamule kuva lukani ugu libihile kugitwa chipindi kya lihungu, kuvecha lihumile ndewo mugati lya vanu.<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu isukulilwa mafuta ukoya ku Betania</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliko 14.3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohani 12.1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yesu peakali ku Betania, kukaye lya Simoni yeakali itamika lukalavilo. <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Maye yumwi yeakali na libochobocho lya yeigelanichwe kwa liganga lyelikemelwa alabasita yeikali na manung'unilo manofu lya sendi ngomi, akamuheleliye pala pamesa peakali ikalie kuliya kyakula, akamsukulila ago manung'ulilo pamtuwe. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Vachulila vake pevagawene ago vakavipile, vakalonga, “Kwa liki tuyagicha sendi ndeni? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Mafuta aga ngagaguchilwe kwa sendi ngomi na vahangala ngavagavilwe sendi icho.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yesu akachelile mahocho gyawo, akavalongile wuli mukumnyengema maye uyu? Mwene anigitile lukani lunofu. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Vahangala vagehe pamwi na nyeye, ila nene sendivecha pamwi na nyenye figono fyonda. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Uyu maye anibakile mafuta mvili vangu, neke akuniandalisa kwa kusilwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Ndikuvalongela ndakyene, peponda pa inyi iyi daidalikwa njowo nofu, lukani ulu lyeagitile maye uyu dalilongwa kwa kumuwuwika mwene.<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda ikwidikila kumkana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maliko 14.10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22.3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Kangi Yuda Isikalioti yumwi va vala kumi na vavili, akahelela kwa vatekechi vakomi, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />akavalongela, “Damukunigavila kinu liki ngita ndikuvaletela Yesu?” Vakamvalalie fipande selasini fya sendi, <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Na kuhuma chipindi icho Yuda akali ikela ng'asi lya kumkana Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu iliya kyakuliya kya pasaka pamwi na vachulila vake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maliko 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22.7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohani 13.21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Kigono kya kwanja peyave lihungu lya mibumunda seivikiwe amila, vachulila vakamueleliye Yesu vakamuhuchile, “Wisaka tukuvikile kwiya kyakula kya pasaka?” <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Mwene akavahigile, “Muhelele kumwani kwa munu tunga, mukamlongele, ‘Muwulanichi alongile, chipindi kifikile kwaveve ndilia pasaka pamwi na vachulila vangu.’” <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Vachulila vakagitile ngita Yesu peavalagiliche, vakavikile Pasaka.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Peifikile palumie Yesu pamwi na vachulila vake kyumi na vavili vakakalile panyi kuliya kyakula. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Pekavali viliya, Yesu akalonga, “Ndikuvalongela ndakyene, yumwi venu dakundikana.” <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Vachulila vakasogwime hilo, vakavangile kuhucha yumwi yumwi, “Mtwa! Wuli, nde nene?” <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu akahigile, “Yeachwika libumunda mu libakuli kimwi na nene nde yeakunikana. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Ndakyene, Mwana va Munu ihelela sake ngita masimbo ga Nguluvi pegasimbilwe, ila dailava munu yula yeakumkana Mwana va Munu! Ngaivecha ngiba kwa munu uyo ngasebabilwe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yuda, yeakasakile kumkana, akamuhucha “Muwulanichi! Nde nene?” Yesu akavahigile, “Veve valonga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyakula kya Mtwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maliko 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22.14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">Vakolindo 11.23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Pevakali viliya, Yesu akanyamula libumunda, akamuhongecha Nguluvi, akaudumula, akavagavila vachulila vake akalonga, “Munyamule muliye ugu nde mvili vangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Baho, akanyamula kikombe kya difayi, akahongecha Nguluvi, akavagavile akilonga, “Munywelele vonda mu kikombe iki, <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />kwakuva iyi nde danda lyangu lya yeiwonesa liangano lyangu nde ndakyene, kwakuva lya vanu volofu neke kuvahechela sambi chawo. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Ndikuvalongela sendinyuwa kangi difai lya msabibu mbaka kigono kila pendinyuwa difai miya pamwi na nyenye mu Ung'achale va Daada vangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Pevamalile kusomola msambo, vakahegile vakahele pakidunda kya Misaituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilagula kuva Peteli akumkana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohani 13.36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Baho, Yesu akavalongela, “Neng'uli palumie nyenye vonda munyila na kundileka kwakuva mumasimbo gasimbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">‘Ndikumtova mkwamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">na lipinga lya kondolo liyaganika.’<verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Ila pendichulubuka ndikuvalongola ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Peteli akamlongela Yesu, “Ata ngita vonda vakuleka ila nene sendikuleka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu akamlongiye Peteli, “Ndakyene ndikulongela, neng'uli palumie peave livisi kuvikile, daukundikana mala chidatu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Peteli akamlongela, “Ata ngita nding'ang'wa kufuwa pamwi na veve, sendikukukana ng'odo.” Vala vachulila vangi vonda vakalonga ndeni ndeni.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ukoya kumgunda mdodo lya Getisamane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maliko 14.32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22.39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Baho, Yesu akahelela pamwi na vachulila vake mumgunda mdodo va Gatesemane, akavalongela vachulila vake, “Mwikale baha, nene ndihelela pala kusuka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Akavanyamula Peteli na vana vavili va Zebedayo, akavangile kuvecha na luswigimo na kugudaguda munumbula. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Baho, akavalongela, “Ndigehe na luswigimo mkomi mu numbula ata pepi kufuwa. Mukale baha pamwi na nene, mubihile kuvasa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Suwe, akahelela pautalo ludodo akaguwa lufuma, akafunya, “Daada vangu ubihile kunigita ndihingile mumagudo gegikwacha nondee, ila ibihile kuvecha ngita pendikeliye nene, ila peukeliye veve.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Peawuyile kwa vala vachulila, akavawene vavasile. Akamlongile Peteli, “Nde kulonga semuwesile ata kukala meho neke mukale na nene ata lisaa limwi? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Mubihile kuvasa ila musuke neke mubihile kwingila mumagecho. Kwakuva Muhe usaka, ila mvili ndi msosovafu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Akahelela kangi mala lya uvili, kufunya, “Veve Daada vangu, ikivecha seiwesekana ndibihile kugachumbila magudo aga makomi, suwe, ugite ngita peukela veve.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Peawuyile kangi, akavawene vavasile, kwakuva vakali na tulo.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Suwe, akavaleka, akahelela kangi kufunya mala lya udatu kwa njowo chila chila. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Baho, akavaheleliye vala vachulila, akavalongela, “Wuli, mwave mugona na kutulula? Mulole! Lisaa liyene ifikile, Mwana va Munu daihechwa kwa vanu vene sambi. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Mulamwike, tuhelele. Mulolele! Ikwacha yula daakuniseduka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ibatwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohani 18.3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Suwe, Yesu peyave ilonga navo, bahobaho akachile Yuda, yumwi va vala kyumi na vavili. Pamwi nave vakaachile vanu volofu vevanyamuwe mapanga na findonga yevalagilichwe na vatekechi vakomi na filongochi va Vayawudi. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Yula yeasakile kumkana Yesu, akali avagavile suwe kimanyilo akilonga, “Yula dandikumuhungila kwa kumkumbatila, nde yumwene, mumbate.”<verse eid="MAT 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Suwe, Yuda akamhegeleliye Yesu, akamlongiye, “Kamwene, Muwulanichi!” Baho akamkumbatila.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu akamlongela, “Mwato, gite kyeusaka kukigita.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Suwe, vala vanu vakamuhegeliye, vakambatile Yesu na kumuwopa.<verse eid="MAT 26:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Yumwi va vala vevakali pamwi na Yesu akakolonjola liwoko, akahomola limage lyake, akamtova msutu va Mtekechi Mkomi akamdumuwe lisigicha. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />“Baho, Yesu akamlongela, wise kimage kikomi kyako muhako vako.” “Kwakuva yeyonda yeitumila lipanga daifuwa kwa lipanga. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Wuli, semuchela kuva ngandivesile kumsuka Daada vangu anitange na mwene bahobaho ngaaniletela mapinga kyumi na gavili vandumindumi vake? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Ila ngita ndikigita ndeni, wuli masimbo ga Nguluvi ngatimilwe wuli, gyegilonga aga ing'ang'wa kugitwa?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Baho, Yesu akaulongela lila lipinga lya vanu, “Wuli, mwachile kunibata kwa limage likomi na findonga ngita nene ndi muhichi? Figono fyonda ndikali pakaye lya Nguluvi, ndikuvawulanicha, ila semukanibatile! <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Ila aga gyonda gagitilwe neke kila kyevasimbile vavichi mumasimbo gatimile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Baho vachulila vonda vakamleka, vakanyilile.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu isindikwa pautalo lya lidamwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maliko 14.53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22.54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohani 18.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Baho, vanu avo vakambatile Yesu vakamsindike kukaye lya Kayafa, Mtekechi Mkomi, na ukoya Vawulanichi va malagilicho na filongochi va Vayawudi vakali vayilundese. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Peteli akamfwatile kwa utali, akaingile mulidamo lwa kaye lya Mtekechi Mkomi pamwi na vadima neke vaveche kulola makani dagivecha.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Baho, Vatekechi vakomi na vadamwa vonda vakasakile uswida va udesi neke vaveche kumdocha Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />ila sevapatile uswida vovonda, ata ndeni vakaachile vaswida volofu va udesi. Pambele vakaachile vaswida vavili, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />vakalonga, “Munu uyu akalongile, ‘Ndivecha kulitunyula Kaye lya Nguluvi na kulichenga kangi kwa figono fidatu.’”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Mtekechi mkomi akaimile, akamuhucha Yesu, “Wuli, seuhiga kinu? Vanu ava vilonga liki kwa veve?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Ila Yesu akachika. Mtekechi mkomi akamlongela, “Ndikulapisa kwa Nguluvi yeagehe wumi, tulongele ngita veve nde Kilisito, Mwana va Nguluvi!”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu akamlongiye, “Veve ulongile! Ila ndikuvalongela, kuhuma nondee damukumulola Mwana va Munu ikalile lubali lwa ndewo lwa yula Mtwa mwene ludali, ikwacha mumafunde gya kuluhano.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Baho, Mtekechi mkomi akademula myenda gyake, akalonga, “Amligile Nguluvi! Vaswida va liki? Nondee mupulike maligo gake. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Nyenye mwiwona wuli?” Vawo vakamuhigile, “Ing'ang'wa kufuwa!”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Baho vakamfunyila mita kuwuso, vakamtova. Vangi vakali vakumtova mimande, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />vakalonga, “Veve Kilisito, lagule nondee, ani akutovile!”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peteli akumkana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maliko 14.66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohani 18.15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Peteli akalili kwivala lyalukani lya lidamo. Suwe mnyigendwa yumwi va Mtekechi mkomi mkidala akamuheleliye, akalonga, “Veve ukali pamwi na Yesu va Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Peteli akakanile pautalo lya vonda akilonga, “Sendikichela uywanga liki.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Peakali ihuma pa mlyangilo, mchulila yungi mkidala akamwene, akavalongela vala vevali pala, “Munu uyu akali pamwi na Yesu va Nazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Peteli akakanile kangi kwa kulapa, “Sendikumchela munu uyu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Pambeli ludodo, vanu vevakali pala vakamuheleliye Peteli vakamlongela, “Ndakyene veve nde yumwi vawo, kwakuva ata kuywanga kwako kukuwonesa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Baho Peteli akavangile kwikotola na kulapa akilonga, “Sendikumchela munu uyo!” Bahobaho livisi likavikile. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Peteli akawuwike makani gyealongilwe na Yesu, “Peave livisi kwivika, ukundikana mala chidatu.” Suwe, akahega kwivala na akavemba kwa kukivilicha.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Yesu isindikwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maliko 15.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luka 23.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yohani 18.28-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Pekukiye, Vatekechi vakomi vonda na filongochi va Vayawudi, vakatang'ine kangi, kusaka ng'asi lya kumdocha Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Vakamuwopa ndegei cha kyuma, vakamsindika kwa Pilato, yevakali mtavala va Kilumi.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufuwa kwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 1:18">Magito 1.18</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 1:19">19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Baho, Yuda yeamseduke Yesu, peawene kuva vamuhigile suwe Yesu, akaichumamanga, akanyamule fipande fya sendi selasini akawuyise kwa Vatekechi vakomi. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Akavalongela, “Ndihongecha kwa kumhecha munu seagitile sambi lyolyonda neke adochwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Ila vawo vakalongile, “Wisaka tugite liki? Ilyo ndi nongwa lyako.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Suwe, Yuda akataga fila fipande fya sendi pakaye lya Nguluvi, akahuma kwivala, akahelela kwitumbika.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Vatekechi vakomi vakanyamula fila fipande fya sendi, vakalonga, “Seing'ang'wa kuhanganisa fipande fya sendi ichi na fipande fya sendi fyefihechwa mulusanja lya Kaye lya Nguluvi, kwakuva fipande ifi fihombilwe neke munu adochwe.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Suwe, vilonganile, vakachitumila kugulila mgunda veukemelwa mgunda va madope va kugalanicha fiviya neke piveche pono kwa kusila vagenji. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Ndeni, mbaka neng'uli vanu vakuukemela mgunda ugo, mgunda va danda.<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Ndeni, makani gya mvichi Yelemiya gakatimile, “Vakanyamule fipande fya sendi selasini, beyi yealongilwe na vanu va Isilaeli, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />vakagula mgunda veukali na madope vakugalanicha fiviya, ngita Mtwa pealagiliche.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato akumuhucha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Maliko 15.2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka 23.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yohani 18.33-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Yesu akahimilichwa pautalo lya Pilato, mtavala va Kilumi. Suwe, Pilato, akamuhucha, “Wuli, veve nde Mng'achale va Vayawudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Yesu akamhigile, “Veve ulonga.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Ila Vatekechi vakomi na filongochi va Vayawudi pevakali vakumuhucha, seakavahigile kinu.<verse eid="MAT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Ndeni, Pilato akamuhucha, “Wuli, seupulika makani gevakulongela veve?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Ila Yesu seakamuhigile ata kinu kimwi, ata mtavala va Kilumi, akadudwive hilo.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ihigwa kufuwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maliko 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohani 18.39—19.16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Akali achoviye kila chipindi kya lihungu lya Pasaka mtavala va Valoma kuvadindulila Vayahudi vevagehe mukiwopo muwopwa yumwi yevamkelie. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Chipindi ikyo kukali na muhopwa yumwi yeakali ichelanika kwa kugita uwofu, litawa lyake balaba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Suwe, vanu pevilundise pamwi, Pilato akavahucha, “Mwisaka ndimdindulile ani pagati lya ava vavili, Balaba awu Yesu yeikemelwa Kilisito?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Akalongela ndeni kwakuva akachela kuva vakamletile kwa mwene kwakuva lya wifu.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Pilato peakali ikalile pakigoda kyake kya kuhiga, mdala vake akamsindikile njowo, “Ubihile kumgita kinu kyokyonda munu uyu musanzi, kwakuva neng'uli ndigudile hilo munjosi kwakuva lya mwene.” <verse eid="MAT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Ila Vatekechi vakomi na filongochi vakavalongela vanu vasuke Balaba ahumichwe na Yesu adochwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Pilato akawauvcha, “Nde ani mugati gya ava vavili yemukumkela ndimdindulile?” Vakamuhiga, “Balaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilato akawahucha, “Nondee, ndigite liki kwa munu uyu Yesu yeikemelwa Kilisto?” Vonda vakalonga, “Adochwe!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilato akauchile, “Wuli? Agitile lukani liki liwofu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Vawo vakalutala kutowa kyoo, “Adochwe!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Suwe, Pilato peamanyile seivesa kugita kyokyonda na ndewo chivangile kuvanga, akanyamuwe malenga, akakalawa mawoko pautalo lya vala vanu, akalonga, “Nene ndihela nongwa pakyanya lya kufua kwa munu uyu, mwichela vavene.”<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Vanu vonda vakalonga, “Nguluvi atutove nefwe na vana vetu kwa iki kyetukukigita!”<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Baho, Pilato akavadindulila Balaba kuhuma mukiwopo, akaswitiliche atovwe Yesu ndomondo, akamuhumicha neke avambwe.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vapuga vakumdanila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maliko 15.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohani 19.2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Kangi, vapuga va Pilato vakamsindike Yesu mugati lya lidamwa lwa kaye lwa utavala, vapuga vonda vakamchingitila. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Vakamfulile myenda gyake, vakamfwaliche lihingila lidung'u. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Baho, vakabotile ingela lya mihomi, vakamfwalise kumtuwe, vakamvikile kangi lusaga muliwoko lyake lya ndewo. Vakafugamile pautalo lyake, vakumbeda vakilonga, “Kamwene mng'achale va Vayahudi!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Vakamfunyila mita, vakanyamula lila lusaga, vakamtovile pakituwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Pevamalile kumgitila ago, vakamfulile lila lihingila, vakamfaliche myenda gyake, baho vakamuhechile na kumsindika kumvamba pakipindilihicho.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu iwambwa pakipindilihicho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohani 19.17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Pevakali vihelela vakamwene munu yumwi litawa lyake Simoni, munu va Kulene, vapuga vakamswitiliche kunyamula lipindilihicho lya Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Pevafikile pono pikemelwa Goligota, “Pono lya Lichege lya Mtuwe.” <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Vakamgavila muhanganiko va difayi na kinukikali. Ila Yesu peagechile akakanila kunyuwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Vakamvambile pakipindilihicho, baho, vakagavine myenda gyake kwa kutova gudugudu. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Pevamalile vakakalile, vakali vakumdima. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Pakyanya lya kituwe pakipindilihicho vakavikile kibawo lyelisimbilwe, “Uyu nde Yesu Mwana va Vayawudi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Vahichi vavili vagudilwe pamwi na mwene, yumwi lubali lwa ndewo yumwi lubali lwa linyigi.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Vanu vevakali vichumba pepi na pono baho vakamligile na kuhogosa mituwe gyao na kumheka, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />“Veve ukayigitile uwesa kutunyula Kaye lya Nguluvi na kulichenga kwa figono fidatu? Ngita veve nde Mwana va Nguluvi! Witange yuve na ukwike kuhuma pakipindilihicho!”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Ndeni ndeni, Vatekechi vakomi pamwi na vawulanichi va malagilicho na filongochi vakamdanila vakilonga, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Akavatangile vangi, ila kwitanga yumwene seivesa! Kuva mwene nde Ng'achale va Vayawudi! Nondee aike pakipindilihicho na nefwe twikumwidikila. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Akamhuvilile Nguluvi na kulonga kuva mwene nde Mwana va Nguluvi, nondee, Nguluvi na amlowole ngita akumkela.”<verse eid="MAT 27:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Kangi na vale vevagudilwe pamwi na mwene vakamligile.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ifuwa pakipindilihicho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohani 19.28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Kuhuma saa sita pamunyi mbaka saa tisa, kisi likahumile inyi yonda. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Peifikile saa tisa Yesu akavembile kwa lichwi likomi, “Eli, Eli, lama sabakitani?” Maana lyake, “Nguluvi vangu, Nguluvi vangu, wuli unilekile?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Ila vanu vevaimile pala pevakapulike ago vakalonga, “Akumkemela Elia.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Yumwi vawo akanyila akanyamuwa lidodoki akachabika difayi yeihatile, akaivikile mukyanya lya lidenge, akamgavila anyuwe.<verse eid="MAT 27:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Vangi vakalonga, “Leke tulole ngita Elia ikwacha kumtanga.” <verse eid="MAT 27:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Baho, Yesu akavembile kangi kwa lichwi likomi na akafuwe.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Baho lipasiya lya kaye lya Nguluvi ikademwike fipande fivili, kuhuma kukyanya mbaka panyi, inyi yonda ikahogosike, maganga gakabachwike, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />makabuli gakadinduka na vanu volofu va Nguluvi vevafue vakachulubuliwa, <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Navo pevakahuma mukabuli, peachulubuke Yesu, vakaingila mumwani va Nguluvi, vakaonekine na vanu volofu. <verse eid="MAT 27:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Suwe, mkomi va vapuga na vala vevali vakumdima Yesu pe valolile luhogoseko lya mganga na lula lukani ukahumie, vakaogwipe hilo vaka longa, “Ndakyene munu uyu akali Mwana va Nguluvi.”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Pono baho pakali na vadala volofu vakilola kwa utali. Avo nde vala vevamfutile Yesu kuhuma ku Galilaya vakimtanga. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Mugati lyao akali Malia munu va Magidala Malia maye vake Yakobo na Yosefu pamwi na maye vawo vana va Zebedayo.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu isilwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohani 19.38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Peifikile palumiye, akachile munu yumwi yeakali na finu fyongofu munu va Alimataya, litawa lyake Yosefu. Nave akali mchulila va Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />akamuheleliye Pilato, akasuka amgavile mvili va Yesu. Suwe, Pilato akavalongela agavilwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yosefu akaunyamula ula mvili, akaugubikila mumwenda mvalafu hilo, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />akauvikile mugati lya kabuli lyake miya lyeakalihongile muliganga. Baho akalivika liganga likomi pautalo lya mlyangilo va likabuli, akahegile. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Malia munu va Magidala na yula Malia yungi vakali vakaliye kuno vilola likabuli.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kabuli lidimwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Kigono kye kifuatile kikalikigono kya kutulula, Vatekechi vakomi na Vafalisayo vakamuhelelie Pilato, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />vakamlongie, “Mkomi, twiwuka kuva yula mdesi chipindi seakafuwa akalonga kuva, ‘Pefichumba figono fidatu ichulubuka.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Nondee lagiliche likabuli lidimwe mbaka kigono kya udatu neke vachulila vake vabihile kwacha kumhicha na kuvalongela vanu kuva achulubwike. Udesi huo va mwiso uvecha mkomi hilo kuchumba ula va pamwandi.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilato akavalongile, “Aya, mnavo vadima muhelele mukadime ngita muwesile.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Suwe, vakahelela na vadima neke validime unofu likabuli, vakamatile lila liganga na kuvaleka baho vapuga.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Kuchulubuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maliko 16.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohani 20.1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Pekichumbile Kigono kya Kutulula, na peifikile kinyolasagala kigono kya kwanja kya juma, Malia va Magidale na yula Malia yungi vakahelela kulola lila likabuli. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Bahobaho likahumila lihogoseko likomi lya inyi, Ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi akahele kulikabuli na akalibilingisa lila liganga akakalile. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Akaonekine ngita welu na myenda gyake ikali mivalafu pee. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Vadima va lila likabuli vakatetema kwa wogofi mkomi, ata vakali ngita vafuwe.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Ila yula ndumindumi va kuluwano kwa nguluvi vakavalongile vala vadala, “Nyenye mbihile kwogofya! Ndichela mkumsaka Yesu yeavambilwe pakipindilihicho. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Kwihela baha kwakuva achulubwike ngita peavalongile. Mwache mpalole pono peakali avasile. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Suwe, muhelele kisatu mkavalongele vachulila vake kuva achulubwike, nondee akuvalongola kula ku Galilaya, ukoya damukumlola. Muwuwike aga gyendikuvalongela.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Ndeni vadala vala vakahegile kisatu palikabuli, kuno vememile na wogofi na lukeduko mkomi, vakanyilile kuhelela kuvalongela vachulila vake.<verse eid="MAT 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Bahobaho, Yesu akatang'ana navo, akalonga, “Kamwene.” Vadala avo vakamuhegeliye vakamfugamile pautalo lyake, vakakolela magulu gyake. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Baho Yesu akavalongela, “Mbihile kwogofya! Muhelele mukavalongele lukolo vangu vahelele Kugalilaya, ukoya vakundilola.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vadima vihelela kulonga gyevawene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Vala vadala pevakali vihelela, vamonga vadima vevakali vidima lila likabuli vakahelela mumwani kuvalongela Vatekechi vakomi njowo chonda chechikahumile. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Suwe, Vatekechi vakomi vatang'anile pamwi na filongochi va Vayawudi na vagitile mupango vakavagavila vala vapuga sendi cholofu, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />vakilonga, “Nyenye mwing'ang'wa kulonga ndeni, ‘Vachulila vake vakachile pamiye, vakamuhicha nefwe tukali tuvasile.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Na ngita mtavala va Kilumi agite kuchela njowo ichi, nefwe twiywanga nave na kuvadima nyenye semwipata nongwa.” <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Vala vadima vakanyamula chila sendi, vakagitile ngita pevalongilwe. Njowo icho chikalutiye kwa Vayawudi mbaka neng'uli.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvahumila vachulila vake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohani 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Magito 1.6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Vala vachulila kyumi na yumwi vakahelela ku Galilaya ku kila kidunda kyeavalagiliche Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Pevamwene vakamfunya, ila vangi vakali sevidikila kuve ndakyene ndi Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yesu akavahegeliye pepi, akavalongie, “Ndigavilwe umwimike vonda kuluhano na painyi. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Ndeni, muhelele mukavagite vanu va inyi yonda vaveche vachulila vangu, mukivabatisa kwa litawa lya Daada na lya Mwana na Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Muvawulaniche kukolele makani gyonda gyendivaswitiliche nyenye. Ndakyene nene ndigehe pamwi na nyenye kigono kyonda mbaka kumwiso va inyi.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>